00:50:51,583 --> 00:50:54,208
-What is it? Are you tired?
-Hit him hard.

795
00:50:55,083 --> 00:50:56,000
Hit him good.

796
00:50:56,791 --> 00:50:58,166
Beat this bugger down!

797
00:51:00,333 --> 00:51:03,041
Brother...
Munna is getting beat up on the road.

798
00:51:04,958 --> 00:51:05,583
Let's go.

799
00:51:06,916 --> 00:51:08,583
Hey!
Why are you telling him?

800
00:51:09,291 --> 00:51:10,125
They are not together.

801
00:51:10,500 --> 00:51:11,750
They are in different directions now.

802
00:51:12,750 --> 00:51:14,250
What say, Vikky?
Am I not right?

803
00:51:14,625 --> 00:51:16,333
What do you think you are saying?

804
00:51:16,791 --> 00:51:19,083
I will wreck every single one who touched him.

805
00:51:19,708 --> 00:51:22,541
-Who the hell is it?
-Tony's boys.

806
00:51:22,541 --> 00:51:23,541
Those jerks!

807
00:51:26,416 --> 00:51:29,041
"We will die together"

808
00:51:32,000 --> 00:51:34,833
"We will stand together"

809
00:51:37,375 --> 00:51:39,666
"We belong to one another"

810
00:51:39,708 --> 00:51:44,375
"I stand by my friend,
I stand by my friend"

811
00:51:45,000 --> 00:51:47,083
"Watch out, we're coming"

812
00:51:47,708 --> 00:51:49,708
"Run and hide behind your mother now"

813
00:51:50,666 --> 00:51:53,208
"Wherever you may be,
Even if your father stands with you..."

814
00:51:53,250 --> 00:51:56,041
"If you mess with my friend,
We'll make sure it's the end of you"

815
00:52:07,708 --> 00:52:12,375
"I stand by my friend
I stand by my friend"

816
00:52:12,958 --> 00:52:17,583
"Be careful, you'll be torn to pieces
You'll be gathering the pieces yourself"

817
00:52:18,375 --> 00:52:21,291
"Even if your brother threatens us
Even if your mother pleads with us"

818
00:52:21,291 --> 00:52:24,041
"We'll crack your ribs
We'll settle the score at your grave"

819
00:52:24,083 --> 00:52:27,916
"We may argue and fight among ourselves
But our stories are ours to tell"

820
00:52:27,958 --> 00:52:29,958
"We face our own fate ourselves"

821
00:52:30,416 --> 00:52:31,416
God damn it!

822
00:52:33,125 --> 00:52:34,458
Finish him off!

823
00:52:35,000 --> 00:52:35,958
Get up.

824
00:52:37,583 --> 00:52:39,750
I will break you to pieces.
Get up.

825
00:52:44,958 --> 00:52:45,458
Up!

826
00:52:46,833 --> 00:52:47,625
Get up, I say.

827
00:54:11,958 --> 00:54:13,250
To heck with you!

828
00:54:18,625 --> 00:54:21,250
Wait, I'm coming.
Stop.

829
00:54:22,083 --> 00:54:23,125
Stop. It's hurting.

830
00:54:24,208 --> 00:54:25,375
Are you going to die for her?

831
00:54:26,750 --> 00:54:27,583
See how he is thrashed.

832
00:54:29,083 --> 00:54:30,333
You'd be killed if we didn't come.

833
00:54:33,291 --> 00:54:34,333
He is one useless fellow.

834
00:54:34,833 --> 00:54:37,458
Did you go and hide
when your friend is getting assaulted?

835
00:54:38,041 --> 00:54:39,375
That kid is better than you.

836
00:54:40,458 --> 00:54:42,125
Hey Chunky,
go get some tea.

837
00:54:44,416 --> 00:54:45,750
What kind of a guy are you?

838
00:54:47,375 --> 00:54:49,250
Is there no one more beautiful
than her in this world?

839
00:54:49,291 --> 00:54:51,333
-Chasing this damn girl
for no good. -Hey!

840
00:54:52,166 --> 00:54:53,375
Stop talking like that about her.

841
00:54:53,583 --> 00:54:54,958
I will.
I'll definitely talk.

842
00:54:55,125 --> 00:54:58,000
-If I didn't show up, you would be beaten
like a dog on the streets. -Hey!

843
00:54:58,583 --> 00:55:00,958
Who asked you to come?
I'd be killed. My foot!

844
00:55:01,291 --> 00:55:02,791
You ask if she's the only one?

845
00:55:03,166 --> 00:55:04,166
Yes, she's the only one.

846
00:55:05,666 --> 00:55:07,416
She is the most beautiful to me.

847
00:55:07,500 --> 00:55:09,125
-I want this damn girl.
-Damn girl?

848
00:55:09,541 --> 00:55:11,125
Didn't you ask me not to say that?

849
00:55:11,125 --> 00:55:12,583
I can say that.
She's my girl.

850
00:55:13,333 --> 00:55:14,333
But you cannot.

851
00:55:16,333 --> 00:55:18,083
I will go any distance for Ammu.

852
00:55:20,416 --> 00:55:22,375
Ammu, Ammu...
Just sit and chant her name!

853
00:55:23,208 --> 00:55:25,250
That's how it is,
when you are in love.

854
00:55:25,375 --> 00:55:28,458
O' Scientist, I beg of you.
Please don't intervine.

855
00:55:29,416 --> 00:55:30,458
He wants to school me.

856
00:55:35,791 --> 00:55:36,541
-Listen to me.
-Aye!

857
00:55:39,000 --> 00:55:41,666
You can go above and beyond for
who appreciate you,

858
00:55:42,208 --> 00:55:45,875
but she doesn't even notice you,
why would you fight for her?

859
00:55:47,250 --> 00:55:49,000
Beautiful girls are more difficult to handle.

860
00:55:50,625 --> 00:55:52,041
They have plenty of choice.

861
00:55:53,916 --> 00:55:56,333
Trust me.
This damn girl will make your life hell.

862
00:55:59,208 --> 00:55:59,666
Sorry.

863
00:56:01,791 --> 00:56:02,458
Your girl.

864
00:56:15,291 --> 00:56:16,125
First time,

865
00:56:17,666 --> 00:56:18,833
I saw tears in her eyes.

866
00:56:21,750 --> 00:56:22,958
I couldn't tolerate that.

867
00:56:24,000 --> 00:56:25,541
I went to take down those guys.

868
00:56:28,291 --> 00:56:30,375
He didnt understand
a thing I said, you see.

869
00:56:30,666 --> 00:56:31,541
Please listen to him.

870
00:56:31,666 --> 00:56:33,791
They are going to prey on you now.

871
00:56:33,791 --> 00:56:35,208
You will be gone if they spot you.

872
00:56:37,416 --> 00:56:39,375
Stop fooling us and going there.

873
00:56:41,625 --> 00:56:43,458
If you go there without telling us...

874
00:56:44,291 --> 00:56:44,916
Don't go there.

875
00:56:47,333 --> 00:56:47,958
Okay?

876
00:56:49,666 --> 00:56:50,166
Okay.

877
00:56:50,875 --> 00:56:51,625
Okay to what?

878
00:56:52,416 --> 00:56:54,500
-I won't go to her without telling you.
-Promise me.

879
00:56:55,583 --> 00:56:57,291
-Promise me you won't go.
-No.

880
00:56:57,541 --> 00:57:00,583
You want a promise?
What's wrong with him?

881
00:57:03,708 --> 00:57:04,583
Fine.

882
00:57:17,125 --> 00:57:20,250
I must seem crazy
for expressing my love

883
00:57:21,291 --> 00:57:22,500
to you in writing, right?

884
00:57:24,041 --> 00:57:26,708
Your supervisor harasses you everyday.

885
00:57:27,625 --> 00:57:29,500
He is bed ridden for two full months.

886
00:57:30,583 --> 00:57:31,583
I'm the one to beat him.

887
00:57:33,541 --> 00:57:36,625
Tony's guys passed lewd comments at you.

888
00:57:37,791 --> 00:57:39,000
I only beat them too.

889
00:57:39,541 --> 00:57:40,500
And got beaten too.

890
00:57:40,875 --> 00:57:41,708
Why is that?

891
00:57:42,916 --> 00:57:44,000
I will do anything for you.

892
00:57:47,666 --> 00:57:48,541
I am not useless.

893
00:57:49,666 --> 00:57:50,458
I am a man.

894
00:57:51,333 --> 00:57:52,458
And I'll take care of you.

895
00:57:54,666 --> 00:57:55,583
And I love you.

896
00:57:57,250 --> 00:57:58,166
And I want answer.

897
00:58:12,916 --> 00:58:15,083
I thought you don't have feelings for me.

898
00:58:16,791 --> 00:58:18,166
But after knowing so much

899
00:58:18,916 --> 00:58:20,375
you still don't react.

900
00:58:21,250 --> 00:58:22,791
Because you are heartless to feel anything.

901
00:58:22,791 --> 00:58:24,250
You are ruthless and insensitive!

902
00:58:50,833 --> 00:58:52,166
What grade are you in?
10 or 12?

903
00:58:57,166 --> 00:58:58,083
I'm older than you.

904
00:59:01,875 --> 00:59:03,375
What did you study?

905
00:59:06,458 --> 00:59:07,000
Degree.

906
00:59:11,000 --> 00:59:12,083
What was your score?

907
00:59:13,791 --> 00:59:14,625
What is this?

908
00:59:15,125 --> 00:59:17,791
Is there no place in your heart
unless my score is 99%?

909
00:59:18,416 --> 00:59:19,625
Starting interviewing me.

910
00:59:29,916 --> 00:59:31,041
Do you know my salary?

911
00:59:32,416 --> 00:59:33,291
15000

912
00:59:34,208 --> 00:59:35,000
Government job.

913
00:59:36,250 --> 00:59:37,083
It's a contract.

914
00:59:38,125 --> 00:59:40,250
But I'll be permanent
from this year.

915
00:59:42,125 --> 00:59:43,000
In the evening,

916
00:59:43,625 --> 00:59:44,916
at home, I teach music.

917
00:59:46,375 --> 00:59:48,000
That earns me 5000.

918
00:59:49,750 --> 00:59:50,666
So in total,

919
00:59:51,208 --> 00:59:52,500
I make Rs.20,000.

920
00:59:54,875 --> 00:59:55,333
You?

921
00:59:56,458 --> 00:59:58,125
Don't even make Rs.20

922
00:59:58,666 --> 00:59:59,583
I can tell.

923
01:00:01,208 --> 01:00:01,708
Go.

924
01:00:02,208 --> 01:00:03,666
Earn 20k first.

925
01:00:04,125 --> 01:00:06,000
Then come to profess your love to me.

926
01:00:09,333 --> 01:00:11,500
I don't say I will accept you then.

927
01:00:14,458 --> 01:00:16,750
You said you were a man, right?

928
01:00:17,750 --> 01:00:18,541
Come back to tell me.

929
01:00:20,291 --> 01:00:23,666
Otherwise the jokers from yesterday
or my supervisor,

930
01:00:25,333 --> 01:00:27,208
are no different from you.

931
01:00:30,916 --> 01:00:32,916
You trouble me everyday too.

932
01:00:34,791 --> 01:00:37,333
Except you don't pass bad comments.

933
01:00:46,000 --> 01:00:46,875
What do you mean?

934
01:00:48,000 --> 01:00:50,416
If I earn Rs.20000,
will you be mine?

935
01:00:51,708 --> 01:00:52,375
I knew it.

936
01:00:53,833 --> 01:00:55,083
This is how you'd understand it.

937
01:00:55,625 --> 01:00:57,125
Leave.
Find a job.

938
01:01:00,125 --> 01:01:01,625
I will get one in no time.

939
01:01:02,083 --> 01:01:04,416
Any call centre would pay me more
than you for my English.

940
01:01:06,166 --> 01:01:07,000
Hello boss...

941
01:01:07,125 --> 01:01:07,625
Yes...

942
01:01:08,916 --> 01:01:09,750
I've a government job.

943
01:01:10,666 --> 01:01:12,291
You find a government job too.
Go.

944
01:01:12,583 --> 01:01:14,125
Why this condition?

945
01:01:15,291 --> 01:01:16,750
It's so hard to crack
a governement job now.

946
01:01:17,125 --> 01:01:17,708
Isn't it, Swapna?

947
01:01:19,083 --> 01:01:19,708
It's true.

948
01:01:21,125 --> 01:01:23,291
That's really hard.
Give me another option.

949
01:01:23,958 --> 01:01:24,708
Exactly.

950
01:01:26,416 --> 01:01:27,250
You can't do it.

951
01:01:27,875 --> 01:01:28,541
Go.

952
01:01:32,166 --> 01:01:33,541
Is there no other consideration?

953
01:01:38,250 --> 01:01:39,458
-Next.
-Ok ok ok, done done.

954
01:01:39,750 --> 01:01:40,750
Government job?
Done.

955
01:01:41,583 --> 01:01:42,208
Deal.

956
01:01:44,833 --> 01:01:46,125
Don't see me till then.

957
01:01:46,791 --> 01:01:48,541
Not even with your bills.

958
01:01:50,375 --> 01:01:51,750
I am serious.

959
01:01:52,375 --> 01:01:53,250
Be careful.

960
01:01:56,541 --> 01:01:57,250
Ahh...

961
01:01:57,625 --> 01:01:58,333
Fine.

962
01:01:59,125 --> 01:02:00,500
I will be in touch till then,

963
01:02:00,916 --> 01:02:01,958
can give me your number?

964
01:02:05,833 --> 01:02:06,375
Hey!

965
01:02:07,083 --> 01:02:08,166
-Thank you, Swapna.
-What are you doing?

966
01:02:08,583 --> 01:02:10,500
It's alright.
Poor guy!

967
01:02:10,750 --> 01:02:13,041
He says he'll find a job for your sake.

968
01:02:13,500 --> 01:02:16,166
Don't you think he needs motivation?
Hey, Munna...

969
01:02:16,375 --> 01:02:18,541
Don't call or message her
because you've her number now.

970
01:02:18,916 --> 01:02:20,458
Be happy looking at her picture.

971
01:02:20,708 --> 01:02:22,583
-Don't come again.
-I will not come.

972
01:02:23,125 --> 01:02:24,708
I will come only after I get a job.

973
01:02:35,000 --> 01:02:36,541
You would wait for me, right?

974
01:02:41,625 --> 01:02:42,708
You won't tell.

975
01:02:43,833 --> 01:02:44,708
But your eyes do.

976
01:03:00,583 --> 01:03:01,708
Government job...

977
01:03:02,375 --> 01:03:03,291
It's confirmed.

978
01:03:12,083 --> 01:03:14,500
You dialled 100.
What happened here?

979
01:03:14,541 --> 01:03:17,541
Yes sir, some goons came by
yesterday and created a scene.

980
01:03:18,000 --> 01:03:20,750
Even that boy over there comes here everyday

981
01:03:20,791 --> 01:03:23,208
-Only to trouble her.
-Catch him.

982
01:03:24,250 --> 01:03:25,083
Where are you guys?

983
01:03:26,250 --> 01:03:27,208
Ammu gave me her number.

984
01:03:31,458 --> 01:03:33,041
Why are you troubling that girl everyday?

985
01:03:33,541 --> 01:03:34,875
-What's wrong with you?
-Hey...

986
01:03:35,375 --> 01:03:36,583
What did you say?

987
01:03:37,916 --> 01:03:39,833
Shut up and move it you idiot.

988
01:03:40,208 --> 01:03:41,583
-What is this?
-Bloody fool!

989
01:03:43,083 --> 01:03:44,458
Why are you hitting me?

990
01:03:44,541 --> 01:03:46,041
-How dare you?
-Who do you think you are?

991
01:03:48,541 --> 01:03:49,666
Bloody idiot!

992
01:03:50,583 --> 01:03:51,541
So what if you're police?

993
01:03:52,125 --> 01:03:53,125
So what?

994
01:03:55,750 --> 01:03:56,416
Catch him.

995
01:04:02,208 --> 01:04:03,291
Leave me.

996
01:04:04,791 --> 01:04:05,708
Let go of me.

997
01:04:12,125 --> 01:04:13,541
Why are you beating me?

998
01:04:22,416 --> 01:04:23,041
Isn't she pretty?

999
01:04:42,583 --> 01:04:43,833
Pass the phone quick.

1000
01:04:43,875 --> 01:04:46,083
Give it back to me or
I will lose my job.

1001
01:04:46,125 --> 01:04:47,708
Give it back.
That's enough.

1002
01:04:48,625 --> 01:04:49,208
Thank you, Sir.

1003
01:04:51,750 --> 01:04:53,083
Should I not see?

1004
01:04:54,458 --> 01:04:55,041
Sorry sir.

1005
01:05:01,208 --> 01:05:03,375
Oh! She is gorgeous.

1006
01:05:03,875 --> 01:05:05,583
You will make a great couple.

1007
01:05:07,375 --> 01:05:09,500
You see that?
Even Swami sir likes us.

1008
01:05:09,958 --> 01:05:10,791
You didn't like though.

1009
01:05:11,916 --> 01:05:13,125
Did we say that?

1010
01:05:13,208 --> 01:05:14,458
You don't have to.

1011
01:05:14,791 --> 01:05:16,083
I could tell from your faces.

1012
01:05:18,333 --> 01:05:21,583
I want to say
you are most lovely couple in the world.

1013
01:05:22,416 --> 01:05:23,083
Enough?

1014
01:05:24,833 --> 01:05:27,166
It is not so clear on the phone.

1015
01:05:28,208 --> 01:05:29,333
You should see her in person.

1016
01:05:29,625 --> 01:05:30,708
Then you will know.

1017
01:05:31,541 --> 01:05:35,708
That there is no one prettier
than her in this world.

1018
01:05:38,583 --> 01:05:40,416
She is beautiful beyond words.

1019
01:05:45,916 --> 01:05:47,833
She is such a catch.

1020
01:06:29,125 --> 01:06:30,625
She looks out of this world.

1021
01:08:19,750 --> 01:08:20,208
Here is tea.

1022
01:08:28,250 --> 01:08:29,875
Daddy, thank you.

1023
01:08:31,500 --> 01:08:32,583
Uncle, did you add ginger?

1024
01:08:33,916 --> 01:08:34,916
I did, madam.

1025
01:08:35,375 --> 01:08:36,625
Good boy.

1026
01:08:38,083 --> 01:08:42,125
I made tea as a kind gesture.
Now you have new demands. Look at her!

1027
01:08:50,500 --> 01:08:53,708
Ammu...
Stop that song for a minute.

1028
01:08:55,291 --> 01:08:56,416
-What?
-Munna...

1029
01:08:56,875 --> 01:08:59,000
Hit someone for calling you a female.

1030
01:08:59,666 --> 01:09:01,083
Just for calling you a female.

1031
01:09:01,833 --> 01:09:03,583
That too a police officer.

1032
01:09:04,208 --> 01:09:06,083
How much love does he have for you?

1033
01:09:08,291 --> 01:09:08,916
What?

1034
01:09:10,875 --> 01:09:13,333
You can go on about him
for another 100 years,

1035
01:09:14,625 --> 01:09:16,458
but I still don't want him.

1036
01:09:18,875 --> 01:09:19,833
You are right.

1037
01:09:20,083 --> 01:09:21,666
We reject those who care for us.

1038
01:09:22,625 --> 01:09:24,625
It's easier to find some moron to marry.

1039
01:09:25,125 --> 01:09:25,833
That's it, right?

1040
01:09:28,625 --> 01:09:29,333
Right.

1041
01:09:37,958 --> 01:09:39,208
What I did...
Hey, listen to me...

1042
01:09:40,291 --> 01:09:41,541
Hey, shut up.

1043
01:09:49,375 --> 01:09:50,500
Looking good.

1044
01:09:53,958 --> 01:09:54,666
Is he your son?

1045
01:09:56,250 --> 01:09:56,958
Yes sir.

1046
01:09:59,125 --> 01:09:59,708
It's difficult.

1047
01:09:59,750 --> 01:10:02,041
Sir, please don't say that.

1048
01:10:02,541 --> 01:10:03,541
He is a good man.

1049
01:10:04,375 --> 01:10:07,125
We know you can surely help him out.

1050
01:10:07,708 --> 01:10:08,250
Please sir.

1051
01:10:08,500 --> 01:10:09,375
How can I help?

1052
01:10:10,375 --> 01:10:10,875
Doesn't he know?

1053
01:10:12,625 --> 01:10:14,375
How to behave with a police officer?

1054
01:10:15,416 --> 01:10:16,291
He is a kid, sir.

1055
01:10:17,666 --> 01:10:18,750
He didn't mean to.

1056
01:10:19,250 --> 01:10:20,541
Have mercy on him.

1057
01:10:26,541 --> 01:10:27,208
That's tough.

1058
01:10:37,208 --> 01:10:39,208
Don't do that.
Don't offer him now.

1059
01:10:40,750 --> 01:10:41,666
Please accept this, Sir.

1060
01:10:42,500 --> 01:10:43,791
And let him go.

1061
01:10:52,333 --> 01:10:53,625
Bribing a police officer?

1062
01:10:56,041 --> 01:10:57,333
-No sir.
-Stand up.

1063
01:10:58,458 --> 01:10:59,041
Stand up!

1064
01:11:00,250 --> 01:11:01,291
Get out.
You stand up.

1065
01:11:03,583 --> 01:11:05,000
You trying to bribe a police?

1066
01:11:05,375 --> 01:11:06,791
Do you know what he did?

1067
01:11:07,333 --> 01:11:08,166
Please sir.

1068
01:11:08,166 --> 01:11:10,666
-He shouldn not have...
-What did I tell you? Get out.

1069
01:11:11,708 --> 01:11:12,083
Brother...

1070
01:11:15,333 --> 01:11:16,708
Do you know what your son did?

1071
01:11:17,833 --> 01:11:19,666
He is harassing girls on the road.

1072
01:11:20,291 --> 01:11:21,375
And you're trying to bribe.

1073
01:11:22,041 --> 01:11:23,458
He is beating up the police.

1074
01:11:23,791 --> 01:11:24,875
Is this how you raised him?

1075
01:11:27,916 --> 01:11:28,541
Munna...

1076
01:11:30,083 --> 01:11:30,666
Come out.

1077
01:11:30,833 --> 01:11:31,875
CA sir is calling you.

1078
01:11:32,125 --> 01:11:32,958
What for, sir?

1079
01:11:33,166 --> 01:11:35,125
Are you taking him for another dose?

1080
01:11:35,250 --> 01:11:37,666
Oh wow!
Only known each other for one day.

1081
01:11:37,750 --> 01:11:38,875
But you are friends already.

1082
01:11:39,166 --> 01:11:40,833
-Is that how tight you are now?
-Sir...

1083
01:11:41,708 --> 01:11:43,291
Let it be for one hour or one day,

1084
01:11:44,000 --> 01:11:45,791
our friends are for life.

1085
01:11:48,375 --> 01:11:49,375
Munna...

1086
01:11:52,333 --> 01:11:53,208
I'll be there for you.

1087
01:11:53,666 --> 01:11:55,208
Chintanna!
Remember that.

1088
01:11:55,291 --> 01:11:56,416
Move it.
Keep walking.

1089
01:12:41,125 --> 01:12:42,291
Why is you here, Daddy?

1090
01:12:44,291 --> 01:12:45,291
Why are you sitting here?

1091
01:12:45,875 --> 01:12:46,541
Get up.

1092
01:12:47,333 --> 01:12:47,958
Sir...

1093
01:12:48,583 --> 01:12:49,708
Why did you bring my dad?

1094
01:12:50,541 --> 01:12:51,708
Why is my dad here?

1095
01:12:52,625 --> 01:12:53,625
Get up, first.

1096
01:12:54,166 --> 01:12:54,625
Get up.

1097
01:12:55,250 --> 01:12:55,958
Stand up.

1098
01:12:56,875 --> 01:12:58,291
Shirt...
Where is his shirt?

1099
01:12:59,041 --> 01:13:00,500
-Give me my dad's shirt.
-Be quiet.

1100
01:13:00,583 --> 01:13:02,041
Why is my dad shirtless?

1101
01:13:04,000 --> 01:13:05,916
Why is my dad here for my mistakes?

1102
01:13:09,708 --> 01:13:10,541
What did you say?

1103
01:13:11,250 --> 01:13:12,375
For your mistakes?

1104
01:13:31,625 --> 01:13:32,958
-Where is he?
-Find out what happened.

1105
01:13:33,416 --> 01:13:34,791
Please come fast, sir.

1106
01:13:44,875 --> 01:13:46,125
File the FIR now.

1107
01:13:47,750 --> 01:13:48,833
We'll see who comes to rescue.

1108
01:13:57,875 --> 01:13:58,458
Munna...

1109
01:13:58,625 --> 01:14:00,791
Why are you sitting down?
Brother Shekhar, get up.

1110
01:14:00,958 --> 01:14:01,666
Stand up.

1111
01:14:03,125 --> 01:14:03,708
Sit there.

1112
01:14:04,666 --> 01:14:06,583
You sit down first.
Don't get tensed.

1113
01:14:07,083 --> 01:14:07,708
I am here now.

1114
01:14:08,375 --> 01:14:09,125
It's okay.

1115
01:14:09,458 --> 01:14:10,291
Just five minutes.

1116
01:14:10,500 --> 01:14:11,666
Sit here and watch.

1117
01:14:13,583 --> 01:14:14,291
What's up, sir?

1118
01:14:18,166 --> 01:14:19,458
Madhusudhan Reddy Sir.

1119
01:14:20,875 --> 01:14:21,625
Who are you?

1120
01:14:23,125 --> 01:14:23,750
You will know.

1121
01:14:24,708 --> 01:14:27,375
You will know
all about me in two minutes.

1122
01:14:28,291 --> 01:14:29,666
Can I see the FIR please?

1123
01:14:30,916 --> 01:14:32,000
You are a lawyer, is it?

1124
01:14:35,000 --> 01:14:36,666
Did you issue the CRPC notice?

1125
01:14:37,125 --> 01:14:37,916
No, I didn't.

1126
01:14:38,583 --> 01:14:41,041
I don't intend to either.
What are you going to do?

1127
01:14:41,333 --> 01:14:42,166
What can I do?

1128
01:14:43,000 --> 01:14:44,541
You striped him shirtless.

1129
01:14:45,041 --> 01:14:46,125
Now I will strip you.

1130
01:14:47,500 --> 01:14:48,500
Strip me?

1131
01:14:49,041 --> 01:14:51,541
Who do you think you are?
Huh?

1132
01:14:51,916 --> 01:14:53,333
Who allowed you to enter?

1133
01:14:54,541 --> 01:14:56,458
Hey!
Who brought him here?

1134
01:14:56,833 --> 01:14:57,291
Ramesh!

1135
01:14:58,416 --> 01:14:58,750
Out.

1136
01:14:59,000 --> 01:15:00,166
Take him out now.

1137
01:15:04,083 --> 01:15:04,541
So?

1138
01:15:05,750 --> 01:15:08,583
...

1139
01:15:09,708 --> 01:15:10,375
Really?

1140
01:15:19,166 --> 01:15:19,750
Yes, Meghana.

1141
01:15:21,166 --> 01:15:24,916
If I don't get my call
in the next three minutes, file the case.

1142
01:15:25,708 --> 01:15:26,083
Yes.

1143
01:15:28,000 --> 01:15:29,416
CRPC 57

1144
01:15:30,541 --> 01:15:31,125
230

1145
01:15:32,291 --> 01:15:32,875
330

1146
01:15:34,208 --> 01:15:35,083
And 331.

1147
01:15:35,666 --> 01:15:37,083
Meghana...
One second.

1148
01:15:38,458 --> 01:15:39,083
Do one thing.

1149
01:15:39,291 --> 01:15:40,041
Remove them.

1150
01:15:40,500 --> 01:15:41,583
We will go for 97.

1151
01:15:42,333 --> 01:15:42,666
Yes.

1152
01:15:43,875 --> 01:15:45,958
CRPC 1973

1153
01:15:52,208 --> 01:15:53,000
What case is that, sir?

1154
01:15:55,250 --> 01:15:56,208
Hebeus corpus.

1155
01:16:14,708 --> 01:16:16,041
Hey, release them.

1156
01:16:19,541 --> 01:16:20,875
Ramarao, Give his shirt back.
Sir.

1157
01:16:21,500 --> 01:16:22,041
Please leave, sir.

1158
01:16:22,958 --> 01:16:23,708
Shekhar bro...

1159
01:16:26,000 --> 01:16:27,041
This is very common.

1160
01:16:27,125 --> 01:16:28,625
Kids will be kids
I tell you.

1161
01:16:30,833 --> 01:16:31,500
Please relax.

1162
01:16:31,750 --> 01:16:33,458
Brother, why are you doing this?

1163
01:16:40,875 --> 01:16:41,791
Bro...
Thanks, bro.

1164
01:16:42,083 --> 01:16:42,708
Hey, hero.

1165
01:16:43,083 --> 01:16:43,500
Bro...

1166
01:16:43,875 --> 01:16:44,375
No, bro.

1167
01:16:45,125 --> 01:16:46,458
Don't call me hero again.

1168
01:16:46,666 --> 01:16:47,458
You are my hero.

1169
01:16:47,625 --> 01:16:49,458
You gave such a tough time to that CI.

1170
01:16:50,833 --> 01:16:51,958
It happens.

1171
01:16:53,625 --> 01:16:55,833
-I'll beat up that Madhusudhan Reddy one day.
-Sure.

1172
01:16:56,250 --> 01:16:56,958
You must beat him.

1173
01:16:57,625 --> 01:16:58,458
Beat him with education.

1174
01:16:59,666 --> 01:17:00,500
Beat him with success.

1175
01:17:01,375 --> 01:17:03,583
Education is everything for us middle class.

1176
01:17:04,541 --> 01:17:06,916
Notice how scared he was
when the two sections were mentioned.

1177
01:17:08,625 --> 01:17:09,625
This is education.

1178
01:17:10,291 --> 01:17:11,500
Go on.
Daddy is leaving.

1179
01:17:11,875 --> 01:17:12,250
Go.

1180
01:17:12,708 --> 01:17:13,458
Thanks, bro.

1181
01:17:18,791 --> 01:17:20,416
Dude, your daddy is leaving shirtless.

1182
01:17:20,583 --> 01:17:22,416
I offered to drop him but he refused.

1183
01:17:29,041 --> 01:17:29,625
Daddy...

1184
01:17:30,083 --> 01:17:31,333
Why are you walking like that?
Stop.

1185
01:17:36,041 --> 01:17:37,208
I asked you to stop.

1186
01:17:38,125 --> 01:17:38,583
Daddy.

1187
01:17:43,333 --> 01:17:44,666
Fine, go.
Bloody hell!

1188
01:17:45,166 --> 01:17:46,000
Do whatever!

1189
01:17:47,666 --> 01:17:49,166
Aunty, look there.
Uncle is coming.

1190
01:17:49,916 --> 01:17:50,791
What happened to him?

1191
01:17:51,458 --> 01:17:52,333
Why is he shirtless?

1192
01:17:54,416 --> 01:17:55,125
What happened?

1193
01:17:56,250 --> 01:17:57,458
Why are you coming like this?

1194
01:17:58,416 --> 01:17:59,375
What's wrong?
Tell me.

1195
01:17:59,791 --> 01:18:00,541
What happened to Munna?

1196
01:18:01,041 --> 01:18:02,125
Why don't you stop?

1197
01:18:03,333 --> 01:18:04,416
Tell me what happened.

1198
01:18:04,833 --> 01:18:06,833
Why don't you say anything?
Tell me.

1199
01:18:07,541 --> 01:18:08,958
What happened at the police station?

1200
01:18:09,333 --> 01:18:11,416
Why did you come back like this?
Where is Munna?

1201
01:18:18,208 --> 01:18:18,708
Daddy.

1202
01:18:19,041 --> 01:18:20,166
-Are you mad?
-Munna.

1203
01:18:21,666 --> 01:18:23,250
-What happened?
-What's wrong with you?

1204
01:18:24,916 --> 01:18:25,416
Daddy.

1205
01:18:27,416 --> 01:18:29,625
-He is not allowed in this house anymore.
-Munna...

1206
01:18:30,583 --> 01:18:31,833
Ask him to go away.

1207
01:18:33,166 --> 01:18:35,000
-Munna...
-He better leave from here.

1208
01:18:36,208 --> 01:18:37,416
I don't want to see him.

1209
01:18:37,541 --> 01:18:38,541
Tell me what happened.

1210
01:18:39,375 --> 01:18:40,666
You should tell me...

1211
01:18:41,125 --> 01:18:43,916
If you let him in,
he will kill myself.

1212
01:18:44,833 --> 01:18:46,708
Why is nobody telling me what happened?

1213
01:18:47,583 --> 01:18:49,041
What did he do wrong?

1214
01:18:49,208 --> 01:18:50,208
Why don't you tell me?

1215
01:18:50,625 --> 01:18:52,333
Is that how you kick him out?

1216
01:18:53,083 --> 01:18:54,708
If I leave now, I'm never returning.

1217
01:18:55,041 --> 01:18:57,583
You think I will come back?
Pushing me out of the house...

1218
01:18:57,750 --> 01:18:58,416
What's wrong?

1219
01:18:58,541 --> 01:19:00,000
-What happened?
-Why are you shouting?

1220
01:19:00,208 --> 01:19:02,333
He held me by my neck and pushed me out.

1221
01:19:02,333 --> 01:19:03,166
Don't shout.
Everyone is looking.

1222
01:19:03,458 --> 01:19:04,375
You keep quiet.

1223
01:19:04,541 --> 01:19:05,208
Shut up.

1224
01:19:05,541 --> 01:19:07,125
They let me go as it wasn't my mistake.

1225
01:19:07,166 --> 01:19:08,875
But he doesn't trust his own son.

1226
01:19:08,875 --> 01:19:10,000
What kind of a father are you?

1227
01:19:10,333 --> 01:19:12,500
I will never come back here again.

1228
01:19:12,541 --> 01:19:13,083
Munna...

1229
01:19:13,958 --> 01:19:15,708
I don't want to see your face,
I'm telling you.

1230
01:19:16,041 --> 01:19:17,583
I will go down a truck.
Bugger off!

1231
01:19:17,583 --> 01:19:19,250
What's this?
Have you lost it?

1232
01:19:19,458 --> 01:19:20,458
Don't come in between.

1233
01:19:20,958 --> 01:19:21,875
-Listen to me.
-Move.

1234
01:19:22,083 --> 01:19:24,000
Looks like he might harm himself.

1235
01:19:24,083 --> 01:19:25,000
Then let him!

1236
01:19:26,958 --> 01:19:30,333
Did you know your son has been harassing girls
out in the open?

1237
01:19:31,041 --> 01:19:34,541
And he admitted that he made a mistake.

1238
01:19:36,208 --> 01:19:37,250
Is he wrong or not?

1239
01:19:43,958 --> 01:19:45,125
How did he turn out like this?

1240
01:19:51,083 --> 01:19:51,791
I don't believe it.

1241
01:19:54,000 --> 01:19:55,500
-Hold him tight.
-Leave me.

1242
01:19:55,625 --> 01:19:56,791
-Stop, dude.
-Let go off me.

1243
01:19:56,875 --> 01:19:57,625
Just wait.

1244
01:19:58,083 --> 01:19:59,416
-Stop right there.
-Leave me.

1245
01:20:03,166 --> 01:20:05,291
You are going to die?
Are we not there for you?

1246
01:20:06,833 --> 01:20:07,583
Let's go home.

1247
01:20:08,875 --> 01:20:09,750
There is no need for that.

1248
01:20:10,291 --> 01:20:11,458
-Listen.
-Munna...

1249
01:20:13,250 --> 01:20:14,333
Go to his house.

1250
01:20:15,083 --> 01:20:16,250
Stay in his room.

1251
01:20:16,500 --> 01:20:17,833
You want to go under a truck for this?

1252
01:20:18,625 --> 01:20:19,500
Look at yoruself.

1253
01:20:20,625 --> 01:20:21,500
Did you eat or not?

1254
01:20:21,750 --> 01:20:23,333
-Come with me and eat.
-Take him.

1255
01:20:26,541 --> 01:20:27,708
I am famished.

1256
01:20:30,166 --> 01:20:31,666
I ate when I went to Ammu.

1257
01:20:33,791 --> 01:20:35,000
I was so hungry

1258
01:20:36,208 --> 01:20:37,666
and he kicked me out.

1259
01:20:37,916 --> 01:20:39,541
Forget it.
It's quite common.

1260
01:20:39,916 --> 01:20:40,916
What father is he?

1261
01:20:41,708 --> 01:20:43,291
You would know
if your father did the same.

1262
01:20:46,958 --> 01:20:47,208
Okay.

1263
01:20:47,958 --> 01:20:48,500
Let's eat.

1264
01:20:48,791 --> 01:20:49,666
Sai...

1265
01:20:50,708 --> 01:20:51,500
Bring Biryani.

1266
01:20:52,750 --> 01:20:53,541
Go with him.

1267
01:20:54,083 --> 01:20:54,833
Bring me chicken.

1268
01:20:55,833 --> 01:20:57,333
I don't want or need anything else.

1269
01:20:57,500 --> 01:20:57,833
Go.

1270
01:21:08,666 --> 01:21:09,875
Remember that guy

1271
01:21:11,375 --> 01:21:13,666
who said he can offer a conductor job
if we pay 50,000.

1272
01:21:14,500 --> 01:21:15,375
That Siddipet guy?

1273
01:21:15,625 --> 01:21:16,666
Are you in contact with him?

1274
01:21:17,333 --> 01:21:17,875
Why?

1275
01:21:19,375 --> 01:21:20,083
Do you want a job?

1276
01:21:22,375 --> 01:21:24,500
Uncle will be very happy to know this about you.

1277
01:21:25,375 --> 01:21:25,958
That's true.

1278
01:21:32,375 --> 01:21:33,833
If I get a government job,

1279
01:21:34,708 --> 01:21:36,041
Ammu says she will accept me.

1280
01:21:36,583 --> 01:21:37,458
Are you dumb?

1281
01:21:38,041 --> 01:21:39,541
How can you chase Ammu, after all this?

1282
01:21:46,458 --> 01:21:46,875
Look at him.

1283
01:21:49,750 --> 01:21:50,333
Fine.

1284
01:21:51,541 --> 01:21:52,583
So what if it is for her.

1285
01:21:53,791 --> 01:21:54,916
Atleast you will get settled.

1286
01:21:56,625 --> 01:21:57,208
That's good.

1287
01:21:57,708 --> 01:21:58,458
Pick up now.

1288
01:22:00,208 --> 01:22:00,750
Eat.

1289
01:22:08,250 --> 01:22:09,416
I won't be a conductor.

1290
01:22:12,000 --> 01:22:13,125
But I'll find something good.

1291
01:22:13,625 --> 01:22:14,083
Okay.

1292
01:22:15,125 --> 01:22:16,458
Let's find you a Collector job.

1293
01:22:26,000 --> 01:22:27,208
What is my darling doing?

1294
01:22:28,125 --> 01:22:28,708
Type it.

1295
01:22:30,708 --> 01:22:32,000
Is my angel sleeping?

1296
01:22:33,125 --> 01:22:34,250
Don't break the flow.

1297
01:22:36,166 --> 01:22:37,583
Ammu, did you eat yet?

1298
01:22:38,500 --> 01:22:38,875
Love.

1299
01:22:40,000 --> 01:22:40,833
You dumbo!

1300
01:22:44,458 --> 01:22:45,125
Hi Ammu.

1301
01:22:46,250 --> 01:22:47,375
This is Munna.

1302
01:22:49,333 --> 01:22:50,125
Good night.

1303
01:22:50,500 --> 01:22:51,416
Sweet dreams.

1304
01:22:52,083 --> 01:22:52,666
Love you.

1305
01:22:53,333 --> 01:22:54,875
This is how sweet it should be.

1306
01:22:55,625 --> 01:22:57,541
It's my first message.

1307
01:22:57,583 --> 01:22:58,958
Use a heart.
Come on.

1308
01:22:59,250 --> 01:23:00,000
Send a heart.

1309
01:23:00,500 --> 01:23:01,750
My heart is with her anyway.

1310
01:23:03,000 --> 01:23:04,000
He doesn't know all this.

1311
01:23:07,000 --> 01:23:07,916
My poetry is better.

1312
01:23:10,041 --> 01:23:10,833
Ammu...

1313
01:23:12,625 --> 01:23:14,083
Where are the rubber bands?

1314
01:23:14,166 --> 01:23:15,916
Just check near the mirror.

1315
01:23:22,041 --> 01:23:23,958
How long will your upma take?

1316
01:23:24,333 --> 01:23:27,583
Making upma and taking forever...

1317
01:23:49,416 --> 01:23:50,541
This is from Munna.

1318
01:23:51,375 --> 01:23:52,875
Didn't she throw it away?

1319
01:23:53,125 --> 01:23:53,958
What happened?

1320
01:23:56,125 --> 01:23:57,083
Upma is ready.

1321
01:23:57,625 --> 01:23:58,333
Shall we eat?

1322
01:23:59,125 --> 01:24:00,333
We will eat upma later.

1323
01:24:00,541 --> 01:24:01,291
Come here.

1324
01:24:02,625 --> 01:24:03,416
What is it?

1325
01:24:04,208 --> 01:24:05,083
Come here.

1326
01:24:06,291 --> 01:24:07,041
What?

1327
01:24:07,875 --> 01:24:09,041
Come.
Sit here.

1328
01:24:20,416 --> 01:24:21,000
What's it?

1329
01:24:24,625 --> 01:24:25,375
What is this?

1330
01:24:34,083 --> 01:24:36,041
Where did you find this?
Huh?

1331
01:24:36,333 --> 01:24:37,875
Where?
Where did you find it?

1332
01:24:44,833 --> 01:24:45,500
Just wait.

1333
01:24:47,166 --> 01:24:48,208
I will pick it up.

1334
01:24:52,666 --> 01:24:54,875
So, that is how much you like him.

1335
01:24:56,583 --> 01:24:57,916
I knew it.

1336
01:24:58,666 --> 01:25:00,666
What's problem with telling me?

1337
01:25:02,458 --> 01:25:05,541
Did you tell yourself
how much you like him?

1338
01:25:18,750 --> 01:25:20,250
What do I do, Swapna?

1339
01:25:22,208 --> 01:25:24,041
Munna doesn't know my reality.

1340
01:25:25,791 --> 01:25:28,458
He is only attracted to my face.

1341
01:25:30,041 --> 01:25:32,833
If he sees me like this,

1342
01:25:33,750 --> 01:25:35,416
he will get shocked and run away.

1343
01:25:37,750 --> 01:25:39,708
Then I will have to kill myself.

1344
01:25:40,958 --> 01:25:42,041
I can't take it.

1345
01:25:43,958 --> 01:25:44,708
That's why,

1346
01:25:45,666 --> 01:25:46,750
I asked him

1347
01:25:48,958 --> 01:25:50,041
never to see me again.

1348
01:25:50,625 --> 01:25:52,208
And I won't see him either.

1349
01:25:58,416 --> 01:26:00,125
This is only for a few days.

1350
01:26:03,041 --> 01:26:04,083
I will forget him soon.

1351
01:26:05,416 --> 01:26:06,583
You can't do it.

1352
01:26:08,791 --> 01:26:09,708
Yes, I can.

1353
01:26:10,458 --> 01:26:11,250
I know this.

1354
01:26:12,041 --> 01:26:14,375
You'll love him more but not less.

1355
01:26:15,791 --> 01:26:17,541
Think about it once.

1356
01:26:18,416 --> 01:26:21,083
Maybe he will accept you
if who you are.

1357
01:26:23,250 --> 01:26:24,916
Even if he accepts,

1358
01:26:26,583 --> 01:26:28,125
won't his life get spoiled?

1359
01:26:30,166 --> 01:26:32,416
How will he spend all this life with me?

1360
01:26:40,541 --> 01:26:41,125
He deserves

1361
01:26:42,500 --> 01:26:45,208
a good girl.

1362
01:26:46,583 --> 01:26:47,291
That's it.

1363
01:27:00,083 --> 01:27:01,791
For the first time in my life,

1364
01:27:05,416 --> 01:27:08,583
I questioned why I wasn't normal

1365
01:27:08,708 --> 01:27:11,666
like the rest of the girl and cried, you know?

1366
01:27:13,208 --> 01:27:14,125
For the first time.

1367
01:27:17,500 --> 01:27:20,583
I feared he would see my clutches,

1368
01:27:21,291 --> 01:27:23,166
and hid them under the table.

1369
01:27:26,583 --> 01:27:27,791
When he was present,

1370
01:27:28,416 --> 01:27:30,166
worried he might see me,

1371
01:27:30,875 --> 01:27:32,708
I wouldn't leave from my place,

1372
01:27:33,333 --> 01:27:35,458
and ate lunch at the table.

1373
01:27:42,958 --> 01:27:44,958
I wore lipstick for him as well.

1374
01:27:49,333 --> 01:27:51,000
I lost my mind.

1375
01:27:52,125 --> 01:27:53,250
I don't understand why.

1376
01:27:57,875 --> 01:27:58,791
Why not?

1377
01:27:59,083 --> 01:27:59,833
That's love.

1378
01:28:00,083 --> 01:28:00,750
That's how it works.

1379
01:28:02,041 --> 01:28:04,375
There is no rule that you can't be in love.

1380
01:28:10,291 --> 01:28:10,791
Yes, there is.

1381
01:28:35,458 --> 01:28:39,833
"To your eyes, I may seem like moonlight"

1382
01:28:39,833 --> 01:28:42,958
"But inside I am an unseen flame"

1383
01:28:42,958 --> 01:28:48,833
"If I become the cause of your pain,
I cannot bear it"

1384
01:28:49,125 --> 01:28:52,375
"Like an eye without eyelids"

1385
01:28:52,375 --> 01:28:55,416
"Like a little child without a mother..."

1386
01:28:55,458 --> 01:29:01,250
"If I become a burden to you,
I cannot go on living"

1387
01:29:01,708 --> 01:29:13,583
"How long can I hide my feelings for you?"

1388
01:29:13,708 --> 01:29:23,958
"How long can I suppress this storm within me?"

1389
01:29:26,875 --> 01:29:38,958
"I can't do it anymore...
Don't chase me"

1390
01:29:39,166 --> 01:29:45,541
"I can't endure it anymore..."

1391
01:29:45,666 --> 01:29:49,916
"Please don't come after me"

1392
01:29:57,666 --> 01:30:03,833
"Even if there were something greater
than the sky itself..."

1393
01:30:03,958 --> 01:30:10,166
"Unable to tell you that you are my world,
I die a little every day"

1394
01:30:10,250 --> 01:30:16,291
"In my world soaked with bitter memories..."

1395
01:30:17,041 --> 01:30:23,166
"If your companionship is not there,
I am no longer myself"

1396
01:30:23,333 --> 01:30:28,833
"This wandering heart would simply stop beating"

1397
01:30:29,625 --> 01:30:35,291
"My love, smile just once"

1398
01:30:36,291 --> 01:30:43,166
"Believe me, I would give you my life"

1399
01:30:46,916 --> 01:30:51,833
"I can't do it anymore..."

1400
01:30:53,125 --> 01:30:57,083
"Don't chase me..."

1401
01:30:59,375 --> 01:31:05,666
"I can't endure it anymore..."

1402
01:31:05,708 --> 01:31:11,625
"Please don't come after me..."

1403
01:31:25,083 --> 01:31:27,666
Vacancy at the Panchayat!
Not happening.

1404
01:31:27,750 --> 01:31:28,875
Hindi teacher wanted in school.

1405
01:31:28,958 --> 01:31:30,750
We can't work at schools and shelters.

1406
01:31:30,833 --> 01:31:31,541
What is this?

1407
01:31:31,666 --> 01:31:32,541
This is not possible.

1408
01:31:33,250 --> 01:31:34,000
This is a bank post.

1409
01:31:34,041 --> 01:31:35,833
You need to be good at math.
You are not!

1410
01:31:36,416 --> 01:31:37,125
He won't do this.

1411
01:31:37,333 --> 01:31:38,083
He cannot work here.

1412
01:31:38,791 --> 01:31:39,666
He won't be able to do this.

1413
01:31:40,458 --> 01:31:41,958
If I can't do this, how can he?

1414
01:31:42,000 --> 01:31:42,708
He is just a kid.

1415
01:31:43,666 --> 01:31:44,250
Exercise?

1416
01:31:45,416 --> 01:31:48,166
-He never exercised in his life,
how can he now? -Hey...

1417
01:31:48,625 --> 01:31:50,875
That's called excise.
It handles alcohol taxation.

1418
01:31:51,208 --> 01:31:51,833
Is it?

1419
01:31:52,166 --> 01:31:54,166
You seem to know everything.
Why don't you search?

1420
01:31:55,375 --> 01:31:55,958
Idiot.

1421
01:31:56,291 --> 01:31:56,708
Hey!

1422
01:31:57,166 --> 01:31:57,625
What?

1423
01:31:57,958 --> 01:31:59,083
Is there nothing for me?

1424
01:31:59,416 --> 01:32:00,000
Looks difficult.

1425
01:32:01,250 --> 01:32:02,791
What a challenge she posed for you.

1426
01:32:03,833 --> 01:32:04,583
Not this way.

1427
01:32:07,416 --> 01:32:09,208
Now what?
Does she only want a government job?

1428
01:32:09,250 --> 01:32:10,875
You will make more money
selling snacks.

1429
01:32:11,000 --> 01:32:11,625
That's true.

1430
01:32:15,125 --> 01:32:17,375
With his qualifications,
he can’t even sell tea on a train.

1431
01:32:23,583 --> 01:32:24,416
Don't blow on me.

1432
01:32:25,416 --> 01:32:26,625
Why?
Is it going to kill you?

1433
01:32:27,166 --> 01:32:28,791
Don't be dramatic!

1434
01:33:04,583 --> 01:33:05,541
How long do you need?

1435
01:33:08,625 --> 01:33:09,291
Dude!

1436
01:33:09,625 --> 01:33:11,041
He missed the most important one.

1437
01:33:12,125 --> 01:33:13,541
-What did I miss?
-Look here.

1438
01:33:21,125 --> 01:33:21,583
Hey!

1439
01:33:22,375 --> 01:33:23,541
This is too difficult.

1440
01:33:23,916 --> 01:33:25,750
But it can be great for you.

1441
01:33:26,750 --> 01:33:27,458
It's a good one.

1442
01:33:27,541 --> 01:33:28,625
Think about it, Munna.

1443
01:33:30,041 --> 01:33:31,958
You must salute every SI and CI.

1444
01:33:33,166 --> 01:33:34,541
You will do their household chores.

1445
01:33:35,541 --> 01:33:38,125
Sooner or later, wash their toilets too.
Right, Sai?

1446
01:33:38,333 --> 01:33:41,000
When a new constable joins,
surely there’s ragging in the department.

1447
01:33:41,458 --> 01:33:43,125
He can wash toilets for his love.

1448
01:33:43,375 --> 01:33:44,000
Won't you wash?

1449
01:33:45,041 --> 01:33:45,666
There...

1450
01:33:47,291 --> 01:33:47,833
Next to it.

1451
01:33:48,958 --> 01:33:50,166
Before constable ad.

1452
01:33:51,583 --> 01:33:52,833
There is an SI, isn't it?

1453
01:33:55,583 --> 01:33:56,958
Don't you see that?

1454
01:33:58,416 --> 01:33:59,750
Are you blind?

1455
01:34:00,541 --> 01:34:02,375
-Oh! Please wait.
-You fools...

1456
01:34:02,791 --> 01:34:03,333
SI?

1457
01:34:04,458 --> 01:34:05,833
What do you think you are?
A lion?

1458
01:34:07,333 --> 01:34:08,541
Tell me the full form of SI.

1459
01:34:08,750 --> 01:34:09,875
Isn't it 'Singam Inspector'?

1460
01:34:10,458 --> 01:34:11,250
What rubbish!

1461
01:34:11,666 --> 01:34:13,458
'Circle'.
Circle Inspector.

1462
01:34:14,125 --> 01:34:14,916
That's CI.

1463
01:34:15,458 --> 01:34:15,958
Oh!

1464
01:34:16,041 --> 01:34:18,250
'Circle' Inspector.
He is right.

1465
01:34:18,375 --> 01:34:18,666
Hey!

1466
01:34:19,000 --> 01:34:19,958
Whatever the Inspector is.

1467
01:34:20,833 --> 01:34:21,583
This is what I want.

1468
01:34:22,000 --> 01:34:22,666
It's the best for me.

1469
01:34:23,791 --> 01:34:24,208
That's it.

1470
01:34:24,541 --> 01:34:25,125
Sure.
Let's go.

1471
01:34:25,458 --> 01:34:26,041
Done.

1472
01:34:26,291 --> 01:34:26,833
What say?

1473
01:34:27,375 --> 01:34:27,708
Hey!

1474
01:34:28,416 --> 01:34:28,916
First,

1475
01:34:29,541 --> 01:34:30,458
-I must tell Ammu.
-Hey!

1476
01:34:30,458 --> 01:34:30,875
Stop there.

1477
01:34:31,166 --> 01:34:31,958
Wait, dude.

1478
01:34:32,833 --> 01:34:34,416
Your head is always filled with Ammu.

1479
01:34:35,458 --> 01:34:36,000
Stupid.

1480
01:34:36,458 --> 01:34:38,375
If this fails,
you'll lose all respect.

1481
01:34:39,833 --> 01:34:41,541
Wants to inform Ammu already...

1482
01:34:41,583 --> 01:34:42,750
He is always ready for it.

1483
01:34:43,083 --> 01:34:43,500
Come.

1484
01:34:45,833 --> 01:34:47,916
Why do you always talk negatively?

1485
01:34:48,333 --> 01:34:50,541
-You and your silly face.
-Tut!

1486
01:34:50,666 --> 01:34:51,916
-Walk, idiot!
-Why are you hitting?

1487
01:34:57,000 --> 01:34:58,916
A constable’s life is like a dog’s.

1488
01:35:04,375 --> 01:35:06,083
Brother, I don't want to be a constable.

1489
01:35:06,291 --> 01:35:06,625
Then?

1490
01:35:07,333 --> 01:35:08,333
He wants to be SI.

1491
01:35:08,875 --> 01:35:09,666
You want to be SI?

1492
01:35:09,875 --> 01:35:10,250
Yes.

1493
01:35:10,541 --> 01:35:11,416
Straight up SI?

1494
01:35:11,833 --> 01:35:12,291
Yes.

1495
01:35:15,250 --> 01:35:15,875
Not possible.

1496
01:35:17,583 --> 01:35:19,083
Have you ever chased anything in life?

1497
01:35:19,583 --> 01:35:20,541
Except for girls?

1498
01:35:22,250 --> 01:35:23,541
Do you even have a life?

1499
01:35:24,208 --> 01:35:25,708
Apart from smoking and drinking?

1500
01:35:27,375 --> 01:35:28,708
Competition will be less.

1501
01:35:29,125 --> 01:35:30,083
Try for Constable job.

1502
01:35:31,958 --> 01:35:32,750
Do you hear me?

1503
01:35:33,916 --> 01:35:35,750
A servant's son is a servant.

1504
01:35:36,083 --> 01:35:37,041
Not a master.

1505
01:35:40,583 --> 01:35:41,458
Whenever you saw me,

1506
01:35:41,958 --> 01:35:43,291
though no one cared,

1507
01:35:44,041 --> 01:35:45,583
you would always ask

1508
01:35:46,166 --> 01:35:49,583
when I would change to be better.

1509
01:35:51,041 --> 01:35:52,625
Now, I want to improve.

1510
01:35:53,083 --> 01:35:54,666
So, I come to you for help.

1511
01:35:55,125 --> 01:35:56,208
But you looked down upon me.

1512
01:35:59,458 --> 01:36:00,250
Makes me sad, Uncle.

1513
01:36:04,666 --> 01:36:05,125
It's okay.

1514
01:36:05,708 --> 01:36:06,375
Let's go.

1515
01:36:08,166 --> 01:36:08,916
Hey, Munna.

1516
01:36:12,000 --> 01:36:12,583
Come here.

1517
01:36:16,250 --> 01:36:16,875
What is it ?

1518
01:36:18,083 --> 01:36:20,208
If you make it as an SI,
I’ll be the first to salute you.

1519
01:36:21,083 --> 01:36:21,916
Do you understand?

1520
01:36:23,541 --> 01:36:26,041
Go and meet Coach Ranjith
in C ground.

1521
01:36:26,833 --> 01:36:28,000
He will train you well.

1522
01:36:28,916 --> 01:36:30,125
You can surely be SI.

1523
01:37:03,041 --> 01:37:04,083
I can't do this anymore.

1524
01:37:07,083 --> 01:37:09,666
-Hey, what happened?
-What wrong? -I can't do this.

1525
01:37:10,708 --> 01:37:12,041
-How many do you smoke in a day?
-Sir...

1526
01:37:12,166 --> 01:37:13,291
You can barely run.

1527
01:37:13,375 --> 01:37:14,666
Panting like an old man.

1528
01:37:16,250 --> 01:37:16,833
Get going.

1529
01:37:17,583 --> 01:37:17,958
Sir.

1530
01:37:18,500 --> 01:37:19,000
No sir.

1531
01:37:19,583 --> 01:37:20,541
I will work hard.

1532
01:37:20,708 --> 01:37:22,291
It's not meant for you.
Don't waste time.

1533
01:37:22,833 --> 01:37:23,333
-Leave.
-Sir.

1534
01:37:23,750 --> 01:37:24,250
Please don't, Sir.

1535
01:37:24,416 --> 01:37:25,333
-I can do it, sir.
-Go.

1536
01:37:25,333 --> 01:37:26,166
Come, let's leave.

1537
01:37:26,166 --> 01:37:28,291
-Just go.
-Why are you pleading him?

1538
01:37:28,291 --> 01:37:29,458
-Who are you guys?
-Bloody heck!

1539
01:37:29,458 --> 01:37:30,541
Keep walking.

1540
01:37:31,208 --> 01:37:33,708
-No chance you'll be an SI!
-You begging him? -Buzz off!

1541
01:37:34,708 --> 01:37:36,041
Why are you blaming him?

1542
01:37:37,208 --> 01:37:38,458
Then?
What should we do?

1543
01:37:39,458 --> 01:37:41,416
Mad fellow.
He is too extra.

1544
01:37:42,208 --> 01:37:43,375
My girl was right.

1545
01:37:44,208 --> 01:37:45,083
That I can't do it.

1546
01:37:48,625 --> 01:37:51,375
She asked me to get a government job
just to avoid me.

1547
01:37:52,541 --> 01:37:53,958
Hey, don't overthink it.

1548
01:37:54,000 --> 01:37:55,041
Take it easy.

1549
01:37:56,916 --> 01:37:57,500
Look here.

1550
01:38:00,375 --> 01:38:01,875
This is my message from that day.

1551
01:38:02,625 --> 01:38:03,750
There is still no reply.

1552
01:38:04,500 --> 01:38:05,375
What do I think?

1553
01:38:06,291 --> 01:38:07,125
She will surely reply.

1554
01:38:07,458 --> 01:38:08,833
I'll share you my poetry.

1555
01:38:09,000 --> 01:38:09,625
She has to reply.

1556
01:38:10,041 --> 01:38:10,916
Please smile now.

1557
01:38:12,375 --> 01:38:14,416
Why are they everywhere we go?

1558
01:38:15,541 --> 01:38:16,125
Hey, dude...

1559
01:38:16,750 --> 01:38:17,250
Yes, bro.

1560
01:38:18,750 --> 01:38:20,541
What are these girls doing here?

1561
01:38:20,875 --> 01:38:22,458
Munna wants to be an SI.

1562
01:38:22,916 --> 01:38:24,666
He is dancing while running.

1563
01:38:25,458 --> 01:38:26,083
Is it?

1564
01:38:26,208 --> 01:38:27,583
So?
You want to be an SI?

1565
01:38:29,000 --> 01:38:29,958
He's going to be an SI.

1566
01:38:30,750 --> 01:38:31,791
You can be his driver.

1567
01:38:32,041 --> 01:38:33,666
And drive him around.

1568
01:38:33,833 --> 01:38:35,708
Go to his house every morning
and polish his boots.

1569
01:38:35,916 --> 01:38:38,041
Polish, polish.
Polish his boots.

1570
01:38:38,083 --> 01:38:39,250
-Let's finish them.
-Hey, relax.

1571
01:38:39,458 --> 01:38:40,708
Munna, back off please.

1572
01:38:40,916 --> 01:38:42,083
Running, jumping...

1573
01:38:42,541 --> 01:38:43,916
is not meant for you.

1574
01:38:44,458 --> 01:38:45,916
Go home and sleep.

1575
01:38:46,291 --> 01:38:47,416
Hey, leave me.

1576
01:38:47,958 --> 01:38:48,583
Bloody coward!

1577
01:38:48,833 --> 01:38:51,083
-You are so dead.
-I will kill you.

1578
01:38:51,125 --> 01:38:52,583
Hold him.

1579
01:38:57,583 --> 01:38:59,333
Listen to me.
Please don't fight.

1580
01:39:01,708 --> 01:39:03,416
Hey, get up.

1581
01:39:03,833 --> 01:39:04,416
Get up.

1582
01:39:08,083 --> 01:39:08,500
Hey..

1583
01:39:09,083 --> 01:39:10,833
-Catch him tight.
-Want to hit me?

1584
01:39:10,958 --> 01:39:12,041
Come hit me now.

1585
01:39:12,708 --> 01:39:13,125
Come hit me now.

1586
01:39:13,791 --> 01:39:14,291
Come hit me now.

1587
01:39:15,166 --> 01:39:15,500
Come hit me now.

1588
01:39:26,500 --> 01:39:29,208
Hey, that looks like Muuna, isn't it?

1589
01:39:29,250 --> 01:39:30,500
Hey, move away.

1590
01:39:38,250 --> 01:39:38,750
Beat him now...

1591
01:39:46,541 --> 01:39:47,541
What are you looking at?

1592
01:39:47,875 --> 01:39:50,750
I will beat you up to pulp
if I see you in this ground again..

1593
01:39:50,750 --> 01:39:52,625
Hi, Chintanna.
What are you doing here?

1594
01:39:52,958 --> 01:39:55,500
I came to beat up some coach.

1595
01:39:55,750 --> 01:39:57,875
-That is who you beat up just now.
-Really?

1596
01:39:58,916 --> 01:40:00,000
Good.
My work is done.

1597
01:40:00,625 --> 01:40:03,250
-He told him he’s not fit even to be a home guard,
let alone an SI. -Ooh!

1598
01:40:03,333 --> 01:40:04,625
And he is requesting that guy.

1599
01:40:04,666 --> 01:40:06,541
Is he the only one to train you?

1600
01:40:06,708 --> 01:40:07,458
Aren't we here?

1601
01:40:08,083 --> 01:40:08,916
Yeah right.

1602
01:40:09,041 --> 01:40:09,583
Brother.

1603
01:40:09,875 --> 01:40:11,250
This is not drinking competition.

1604
01:40:11,333 --> 01:40:12,458
-Is it?
-It is SI training.

1605
01:40:13,125 --> 01:40:13,875
Hey...

1606
01:40:14,791 --> 01:40:17,000
Do you want to see how goons like us

1607
01:40:17,041 --> 01:40:19,208
will train you to become an SI?

1608
01:40:19,583 --> 01:40:20,083
Huh?

1609
01:40:20,500 --> 01:40:21,583
Hey, Munna...

1610
01:40:22,708 --> 01:40:24,041
You will be a police officer.

1611
01:40:24,208 --> 01:40:25,458
You will marry your girl.

1612
01:40:26,083 --> 01:40:27,958
And we will come to bless you.

1613
01:40:28,666 --> 01:40:30,458
That is for sure to happen.
Trust me.

1614
01:40:31,083 --> 01:40:34,166
Yayy!

1615
01:40:42,916 --> 01:40:46,625
"Start our guy’s training!"

1616
01:40:46,958 --> 01:40:49,416
"This is where it begins, son!
Run bro… "

1617
01:40:50,666 --> 01:40:51,875
"Come on, run bro!"

1618
01:40:53,375 --> 01:40:55,875
"From today, running must become your heartbeat"

1619
01:40:55,875 --> 01:40:58,375
"Your legs must race like your heartbeats"

1620
01:40:58,375 --> 01:41:00,833
"The fat beneath your skin must fly away"

1621
01:41:00,875 --> 01:41:03,208
"Become smooth and fit like a boiled egg"

1622
01:41:03,208 --> 01:41:06,750
"Run, boy!
Come on, run!"

1623
01:41:08,291 --> 01:41:11,708
"Run bro… Come on, run bro!
Run bro… Hey, run bro!"

1624
01:41:22,708 --> 01:41:25,333
"Who was that guy who commented you?"

1625
01:41:25,333 --> 01:41:27,791
"I'll tear his shorts and teach a lesson!"

1626
01:41:28,041 --> 01:41:30,416
"Show him the fire and make him regret it"

1627
01:41:30,458 --> 01:41:33,000
"Show your commitment to those who commented on you"

1628
01:41:33,041 --> 01:41:35,458
"Feeling hungry, brother? I’ll bring you a protein shake"

1629
01:41:35,500 --> 01:41:38,000
"If you even say biryani, I’ll punish you hard"

1630
01:41:38,000 --> 01:41:40,458
"With Don Chintu's coaching,
I'll make you win medals"

1631
01:41:40,458 --> 01:41:42,916
"I’ll build your thighs
strong like Usain Bolt"

1632
01:41:42,958 --> 01:41:47,083
"Brother, such wise words from you
gave me goosebumps I say"

1633
01:41:47,875 --> 01:41:50,083
"All the narrow streets with potholes
must become your training ground"

1634
01:41:50,083 --> 01:41:52,625
"Your hard work must turn
the whole path green with success"

1635
01:41:52,666 --> 01:41:55,291
"When you remove your socks,
even your ankles should bleed"

1636
01:41:55,333 --> 01:41:57,750
"A movie should be made
saying 'Run Munna Run'!'”

1637
01:41:57,791 --> 01:42:01,458
"Run bro… Come on, run bro!"

1638
01:42:02,708 --> 01:42:06,375
"Run bro… Hey, run bro!!"

1639
01:42:12,625 --> 01:42:16,166
"Run, boy!
That's it, run!"

1640
01:42:16,333 --> 01:42:17,250
Okay!

1641
01:42:19,166 --> 01:42:20,833
That's greats news.

1642
01:42:21,416 --> 01:42:23,500
Finally, he has started looking for a job.

1643
01:42:24,708 --> 01:42:26,333
Is uncle still angry now?

1644
01:42:27,125 --> 01:42:28,541
Speak softly. He's right here.

1645
01:42:30,208 --> 01:42:31,750
He didn't misbehave with anyone.

1646
01:42:34,250 --> 01:42:35,916
He really likes that girl, Aunty.

1647
01:42:36,500 --> 01:42:37,083
Have some tea.

1648
01:42:39,416 --> 01:42:41,208
She's the one
who told him to find a job.

1649
01:42:48,875 --> 01:42:51,250
"Come on, come on boys,
be on the mission"

1650
01:42:51,375 --> 01:42:53,875
"It’s warm-up time,
take your position"

1651
01:42:53,916 --> 01:42:56,333
"Stretch, stretch, stretch...
Stretch like a crane"

1652
01:42:56,375 --> 01:42:58,833
"Hop, hop, hop...
Hop like a squirrel"

1653
01:42:58,833 --> 01:43:01,125
"Jump, jump, jump...
Jump like a frog"

1654
01:43:01,166 --> 01:43:03,750
"Run, run, run...
Run like a cheetah"

1655
01:43:03,791 --> 01:43:06,250
"Pick up the stick…
throw it into the air"

1656
01:43:06,250 --> 01:43:08,625
"Spin the ball…
reach your goal"

1657
01:43:08,750 --> 01:43:10,416
"You must strike back, Munna!!"

1658
01:43:11,208 --> 01:43:13,666
"The ones who doubted you
The ones who abandoned you"

1659
01:43:13,666 --> 01:43:15,916
"The backstabbers
The ones who wished for your downfall"

1660
01:43:15,958 --> 01:43:18,458
"Tomorrow all their mouths must be shut"

1661
01:43:18,625 --> 01:43:21,083
"They must burn seeing Munna’s victory"

1662
01:43:21,125 --> 01:43:24,458
"Run bro… Come on, run bro!"

1663
01:43:26,041 --> 01:43:29,458
"Run bro… Hey, run bro!"

1664
01:43:35,958 --> 01:43:38,125
"Wake up!
Lace up!"

1665
01:43:38,416 --> 01:43:40,541
"No rest, go get it"

1666
01:43:40,875 --> 01:43:43,375
"Fall down, rise up
One dream, work hard"

1667
01:43:43,375 --> 01:43:45,791
"Train hard, stay strong
Unlock beast mode"

1668
01:43:45,833 --> 01:43:48,333
"Train hard, stay strong,
unlock beast mode"

1669
01:43:48,333 --> 01:43:51,000
"Don’t quit, drop sweat
Face the race, love the pain"

1670
01:43:51,333 --> 01:43:53,333
"Love the pain… love the pain…"

1671
01:43:53,375 --> 01:43:55,666
“Don’t accept tiredness until victory arrives
Run like a cheetah until the very end”

1672
01:43:55,708 --> 01:43:58,166
“Shake off your failures, don’t carry sadness
Show your courage, write your story into history”

1673
01:43:58,208 --> 01:44:00,625
“Don’t stop moving, leave your sleep behind
Half-hearted efforts, are never enough”

1674
01:44:00,666 --> 01:44:03,166
“Fall again and again, but keep taking steps forward
The final turn, is where victory waits”

1675
01:44:03,166 --> 01:44:05,583
“Say goodbye, to your daydreams
The path of blood and sweat, is the warrior’s chant”

1676
01:44:05,625 --> 01:44:09,875
“Half is pride, half is attitude
Mix them together, and run… run!”

1677
01:44:30,875 --> 01:44:33,750
Oh wow!
Those goons have trained you well.

1678
01:44:33,791 --> 01:44:35,250
You'll soon be SI.

1679
01:44:35,875 --> 01:44:38,625
And very soon, I will marry Ammu.

1680
01:44:40,583 --> 01:44:41,666
We shall have a daughter.

1681
01:44:42,791 --> 01:44:44,125
She'll look just like Ammu.

1682
01:44:44,875 --> 01:44:45,625
Like a doll.

1683
01:44:46,291 --> 01:44:48,375
-Let's take a selfie.
-Sure.

1684
01:45:02,708 --> 01:45:04,291
Here is our Sunday special.

1685
01:45:04,916 --> 01:45:06,291
Hmm... Mutton.

1686
01:45:06,541 --> 01:45:07,041
That's all?

1687
01:45:08,166 --> 01:45:08,791
Won't you eat?

1688
01:45:09,166 --> 01:45:11,333
I will eat later.
My stomach is upset.

1689
01:45:11,583 --> 01:45:12,208
Why is that?

1690
01:45:15,125 --> 01:45:16,458
This mutton looks smacking.

1691
01:45:31,583 --> 01:45:33,625
What wrong?
My sister-in-law cooked.

1692
01:45:33,833 --> 01:45:34,416
How's it?

1693
01:45:37,000 --> 01:45:38,166
I didn't ask.

1694
01:45:38,625 --> 01:45:39,458
Bloody scoundrel!

1695
01:45:40,250 --> 01:45:41,333
Munna, wait.

1696
01:45:41,625 --> 01:45:43,375
-Just wait.
-Let me go.

1697
01:45:45,875 --> 01:45:48,000
-All drama.
-Please stop.

1698
01:45:48,041 --> 01:45:49,291
Munna, wait.
Please listen.

1699
01:45:49,500 --> 01:45:50,541
Munna!
Hey...

1700
01:45:53,833 --> 01:45:55,208
Why would you throw away food?

1701
01:45:55,208 --> 01:45:57,250
Just shut up now.
Bloody hell!

1702
01:45:57,958 --> 01:46:00,750
Kicked me out of the house and sent me
mutton to eat?

1703
01:46:02,875 --> 01:46:04,541
Are you mad to shout like this?

1704
01:46:04,666 --> 01:46:06,750
-Keep quiet.
-You think I've nothing to eat?

1705
01:46:06,791 --> 01:46:08,875
Whatever it is!
How could you throw away food?

1706
01:46:09,250 --> 01:46:11,750
You think I am a begger?

1707
01:46:13,583 --> 01:46:16,000
I don't need your help.
Understand?

1708
01:46:16,500 --> 01:46:19,666
Now that I gave it back
ask him to relish it properly.

1709
01:46:19,833 --> 01:46:20,708
Don't say such things.

1710
01:46:22,000 --> 01:46:24,500
I don't want their fake love.
Leave me alone.

1711
01:46:27,458 --> 01:46:28,833
Didn't I say no?

1712
01:46:29,166 --> 01:46:32,208
He made me cook for him and send.

1713
01:46:32,833 --> 01:46:33,625
Did you see

1714
01:46:34,041 --> 01:46:35,041
how he flung it?

1715
01:46:48,166 --> 01:46:50,708
Im not a good guy, Ammu.

1716
01:46:51,750 --> 01:46:53,791
I hurt my mom alot today.

1717
01:46:54,791 --> 01:46:57,041
Why i want to share everything with you, Ammu?

1718
01:46:58,166 --> 01:47:00,083
You didn't care anything!

1719
01:47:00,875 --> 01:47:02,791
Once, please give a reply, Ammu.

1720
01:47:15,833 --> 01:47:16,666
Hey...

1721
01:47:19,208 --> 01:47:20,083
-What is it?
-Come here.

1722
01:47:24,791 --> 01:47:25,666
My brother is there.

1723
01:47:26,666 --> 01:47:27,958
Hand this to him as rent.

1724
01:47:28,541 --> 01:47:30,125
Return his own money to him?

1725
01:47:30,625 --> 01:47:32,458
It's okay, just do it.
I'll also come.

1726
01:47:38,666 --> 01:47:39,416
Ramanna...

1727
01:47:40,000 --> 01:47:40,583
What's up?

1728
01:47:42,041 --> 01:47:43,333
-Here.
-What's that?

1729
01:47:43,916 --> 01:47:44,583
It's...

1730
01:47:45,125 --> 01:47:47,791
Rent for staying in your house.
Take it.

1731
01:47:53,375 --> 01:47:54,541
What is he to me?

1732
01:47:56,500 --> 01:47:57,041
He's your brother.

1733
01:47:57,541 --> 01:47:58,250
What about you?

1734
01:48:01,208 --> 01:48:03,666
If he's my brother, what are you to me?

1735
01:48:04,041 --> 01:48:04,916
Aren't you my brother?

1736
01:48:05,958 --> 01:48:08,625
You think you are so grown up to pay me rent?

1737
01:48:08,791 --> 01:48:09,833
Keep it inside.

1738
01:48:10,166 --> 01:48:12,250
I'm sorry, brother.

1739
01:48:13,916 --> 01:48:14,541
I heard

1740
01:48:14,833 --> 01:48:16,583
you've passed the written exam.

1741
01:48:16,833 --> 01:48:19,041
-True.
-Eat well. Train well.

1742
01:48:19,375 --> 01:48:21,666
You're must become an SI
not Constable.

1743
01:48:23,000 --> 01:48:26,041
Not an SI that accepts bribes.

1744
01:48:26,291 --> 01:48:27,916
I'll come to your police station to wack you.

1745
01:48:28,708 --> 01:48:30,750
-Fine.
-It's okay. He can take bribes.

1746
01:48:31,000 --> 01:48:33,250
Shut up.
You think everyone is cunning like you?

1747
01:48:33,916 --> 01:48:36,125
You will have problems.
You should overcome them.

1748
01:48:36,208 --> 01:48:37,375
That's where respect is.

1749
01:48:37,958 --> 01:48:39,500
Learn from your father.

1750
01:48:39,583 --> 01:48:41,875
Do you realise how respected
Mr. Shekar is in our area?

1751
01:48:42,000 --> 01:48:43,458
He is very well-respected.

1752
01:48:43,666 --> 01:48:44,541
Munna...

1753
01:48:44,625 --> 01:48:47,291
I know your father from before you were born.

1754
01:48:47,708 --> 01:48:48,291
Sure.

1755
01:48:49,041 --> 01:48:50,625
I should learn from him.

1756
01:48:50,791 --> 01:48:52,250
To kick his own son out of the house.

1757
01:48:52,625 --> 01:48:53,083
So?

1758
01:48:53,625 --> 01:48:54,291
So what now?

1759
01:48:54,583 --> 01:48:55,125
Brother...

1760
01:48:55,583 --> 01:48:57,791
You can talk about anything but that man.

1761
01:48:59,375 --> 01:49:00,166
That man?

1762
01:49:01,291 --> 01:49:03,541
That's your father you are taking about.

1763
01:49:04,916 --> 01:49:06,333
What do you know about him?

1764
01:49:07,375 --> 01:49:09,458
Training for two days got you in bed.

1765
01:49:10,541 --> 01:49:13,125
He works for ten hours straight everyday.

1766
01:49:14,083 --> 01:49:15,958
Have you ever seen what he does?

1767
01:49:26,500 --> 01:49:29,916
He is up on his feet from morning to night.

1768
01:49:31,208 --> 01:49:32,208
Bloody hell!

1769
01:49:32,416 --> 01:49:35,000
His boss doesn't even provide a chair to sit.

1770
01:49:43,000 --> 01:49:45,166
Every day, your mother massages his legs.

1771
01:49:46,458 --> 01:49:47,833
Did you ever ask?

1772
01:49:48,500 --> 01:49:50,208
Why his legs hurt so much?

1773
01:49:52,333 --> 01:49:55,250
Or did you massage his legs ever?

1774
01:49:58,125 --> 01:50:00,541
A father’s legs endure the most strain.

1775
01:50:03,208 --> 01:50:06,583
God doesn't live in temple, churche or mosque.

1776
01:50:07,291 --> 01:50:10,166
Your mom and dad are the real Gods.

1777
01:50:14,958 --> 01:50:16,458
Why does he work so hard?

1778
01:50:18,375 --> 01:50:19,333
Isn't it for you?

1779
01:50:22,041 --> 01:50:23,333
You think you grew up by yourself?

1780
01:50:24,083 --> 01:50:26,625
And you have the audacity to call him 'man'?

1781
01:50:29,166 --> 01:50:32,791
Do you know you use half his salary
just for your pointless whims?

1782
01:50:40,708 --> 01:50:43,875
No matter how much you cry
when they are gone, they won't return.

1783
01:50:46,666 --> 01:50:49,083
You should take good care of them
while you can.

1784
01:50:51,875 --> 01:50:57,500
Our parents are the happiest
when we succeed in life.

1785
01:51:00,791 --> 01:51:02,500
We must win only for them.

1786
01:51:42,708 --> 01:51:44,208
What is he doing there during exams?

1787
01:51:45,083 --> 01:51:45,875
I am coming.

1788
01:51:46,583 --> 01:51:46,958
Ok.

1789
01:51:48,041 --> 01:51:49,333
Hey, what is this?

1790
01:51:49,708 --> 01:51:50,750
Why are you coming?

1791
01:51:51,125 --> 01:51:52,291
I am Ammu's friend.

1792
01:51:54,125 --> 01:51:55,375
Can you come with me please?

1793
01:52:11,458 --> 01:52:12,958
What happend?
Is it Polio?

1794
01:52:13,958 --> 01:52:14,625
Actually

1795
01:52:16,416 --> 01:52:17,583
She is without both legs.

1796
01:52:28,291 --> 01:52:29,500
Your friend doesn't know.

1797
01:52:32,041 --> 01:52:35,083
He always looked only above the table.

1798
01:52:35,833 --> 01:52:37,000
He didn't notice this.

1799
01:52:41,041 --> 01:52:44,166
Oh God! Poor guy.
How can this happen to him?

1800
01:52:44,875 --> 01:52:46,416
Gosh!
How do we tell him now?

1801
01:52:46,833 --> 01:52:49,625
He thinks he has the most beautiful girlfriend
and a perfect love story.

1802
01:52:49,666 --> 01:52:51,541
His love fell apart, just like mine.

1803
01:52:51,791 --> 01:52:54,916
I don't know how to tell him this.
God damnit!

1804
01:52:55,291 --> 01:52:57,000
-Why don't you say anything?
-Hey, stop it.

1805
01:52:57,041 --> 01:52:57,875
What is your problem?

1806
01:52:58,958 --> 01:53:01,000
Stop rattling about it.
We are not telling him now.

1807
01:53:01,041 --> 01:53:02,791
We will see when he lands the job.

1808
01:53:21,000 --> 01:53:23,375
All the best for tomorrow, Munna.

1809
01:53:26,458 --> 01:53:27,166
Sit properly.

1810
01:53:42,250 --> 01:53:42,916
Hey, Vikram...

1811
01:53:43,000 --> 01:53:43,500
Munna...?

1812
01:53:44,208 --> 01:53:44,750
Vikram?

1813
01:53:45,041 --> 01:53:46,166
Vikram...
Get up.

1814
01:53:47,291 --> 01:53:47,958
Vikram...

1815
01:53:52,916 --> 01:53:55,125
-Who the hell are you?
-Vikram...

1816
01:53:55,291 --> 01:53:56,583
-Hey, move it.
-Hey!

1817
01:53:59,916 --> 01:54:00,583
What's up, fatso?

1818
01:54:01,333 --> 01:54:03,333
You are always the first to run.

1819
01:54:03,833 --> 01:54:05,000
Why are you still here today?

1820
01:54:08,958 --> 01:54:10,125
Take him and escape.

1821
01:54:12,458 --> 01:54:13,375
What about you, hero?

1822
01:54:14,125 --> 01:54:15,375
You want to be an SI?

1823
01:54:20,291 --> 01:54:21,916
How can you run
when I break your legs?

1824
01:54:26,125 --> 01:54:26,916
Like this?

1825
01:54:32,875 --> 01:54:34,208
I will smash your face first.

1826
01:54:36,375 --> 01:54:38,166
You scoundrel!

1827
01:54:45,875 --> 01:54:47,333
You move aside.

1828
01:54:51,000 --> 01:54:52,541
-I will kill you all.
-Leave from here.

1829
01:54:53,583 --> 01:54:55,833
-Go away.
Don't get involved. -You?

1830
01:54:56,125 --> 01:54:58,000
They will finish you off.
Move it.

1831
01:54:58,750 --> 01:55:00,083
I will die.
It's okay.

1832
01:55:00,583 --> 01:55:02,166
You leave.
Will you go or not?

1833
01:55:04,000 --> 01:55:04,958
Go, I say.

1834
01:55:06,708 --> 01:55:08,208
Hey Munna,
just leave.

1835
01:55:08,583 --> 01:55:09,791
Why will I go?
Are you mad?

1836
01:55:09,791 --> 01:55:11,791
You must leave.
Go on.

1837
01:55:13,250 --> 01:55:14,208
Listen to me.

1838
01:55:17,000 --> 01:55:19,500
If you don't go now,
you won't get a job tomorrow.

1839
01:55:19,666 --> 01:55:21,541
There will be no Ammu in your life.

1840
01:55:21,750 --> 01:55:23,750
Please leave.
Go!

1841
01:55:34,416 --> 01:55:35,333
Munna, run.

1842
01:55:37,875 --> 01:55:38,500
Damn it.

1843
01:55:44,166 --> 01:55:45,833
Leave him.
Hold him tight.

1844
01:55:53,750 --> 01:55:54,291
Hold him.

1845
01:55:58,291 --> 01:55:59,208
Bloody fatso!

1846
01:56:19,041 --> 01:56:20,875
VIKRAM!

1847
01:56:32,958 --> 01:56:33,875
Make him stand... Make him stand...
Make him stand...

1848
01:56:36,666 --> 01:56:37,583
Hold him... Hold him...

1849
01:56:43,333 --> 01:56:45,041
Munna, why did you come back?

1850
01:56:45,125 --> 01:56:46,958
I don't care about the job or the girl.

1851
01:56:47,166 --> 01:56:49,125
-Let it be.
-Will you go or not?

1852
01:57:59,916 --> 01:58:00,958
His head is broken.

1853
01:58:04,875 --> 01:58:06,541
Take him to the hospital, you fool.

1854
01:58:07,250 --> 01:58:08,000
-Munna...
-Get up.

1855
01:58:08,333 --> 01:58:09,500
His head is broken.

1856
01:58:09,833 --> 01:58:11,750
-Vikram...
-His head craked. Moves.

1857
01:58:12,041 --> 01:58:13,916
-We must leave now.
-He is dying.

1858
01:58:19,083 --> 01:58:19,583
Get up.

1859
01:58:20,791 --> 01:58:21,583
Please start.

1860
01:58:23,041 --> 01:58:23,500
Let's go.

1861
01:58:31,458 --> 01:58:33,708
Aunty, Munna is beat up.

1862
01:58:34,125 --> 01:58:34,833
Hey Anusha...

1863
01:58:38,583 --> 01:58:39,000
Come.

1864
01:58:39,208 --> 01:58:40,333
-Munna?
-They'll make a scene now.

1865
01:58:41,583 --> 01:58:42,125
Munna...

1866
01:58:42,500 --> 01:58:43,916
What happened to him?

1867
01:58:44,041 --> 01:58:45,208
Nothing.
Leave it, Mummy.

1868
01:58:46,333 --> 01:58:48,083
-We got into a fight.
-What do you mean?

1869
01:58:48,583 --> 01:58:49,375
What kind of fight?

1870
01:58:49,708 --> 01:58:50,458
Come home.

1871
01:58:50,583 --> 01:58:51,291
I don't want to come.

1872
01:58:51,416 --> 01:58:52,833
-Hey... I'll slap you.
-That's not my house.

1873
01:58:53,291 --> 01:58:54,750
Don't do this.
Come inside.

1874
01:58:55,083 --> 01:58:56,833
Your mom is calling you in.
Go now.

1875
01:58:57,375 --> 01:58:59,416
-Come inside.
-Nothing happened. Relax.

1876
01:59:00,166 --> 01:59:00,750
Sit.

1877
01:59:02,541 --> 01:59:04,916
What's this?
How did you get hurt?

1878
01:59:05,916 --> 01:59:07,166
Who's that?
Who hit him?

1879
01:59:07,166 --> 01:59:08,708
Tony's gang attacked us.

1880
01:59:10,000 --> 01:59:12,166
Gosh!
You got hurt badly.

1881
01:59:12,375 --> 01:59:14,333
-Let's go to the hospital.
-We're coming from the hospital.

1882
01:59:14,500 --> 01:59:16,333
They said not to worry,
it's a minor injury.

1883
01:59:17,000 --> 01:59:17,791
What happened?

1884
01:59:18,458 --> 01:59:19,833
Someone hit him.

1885
01:59:20,708 --> 01:59:22,916
Let's go to the police station and file a complaint.

1886
01:59:24,125 --> 01:59:25,666
How can we be quiet about it?

1887
01:59:25,875 --> 01:59:26,958
Look how badly they hit him.

1888
01:59:27,458 --> 01:59:28,875
Nasty fellows!

1889
01:59:29,000 --> 01:59:30,500
I am fine, mummy.

1890
01:59:31,375 --> 01:59:34,208
How can you say nothing happened?
You got hurt badly.

1891
01:59:34,208 --> 01:59:35,250
How are you fine?

1892
01:59:35,458 --> 01:59:37,041
Don't you have final exam tomorrow?

1893
01:59:40,083 --> 01:59:41,541
You don't have to attend that.

1894
01:59:41,708 --> 01:59:42,333
Uncle...

1895
01:59:43,208 --> 01:59:44,208
He worked very hard for it.

1896
01:59:44,791 --> 01:59:46,625
It's a minor injury.
He'll go tomorrow.

1897
01:59:48,791 --> 01:59:49,833
How can he go?

1898
01:59:51,125 --> 01:59:52,166
No need to go.

1899
01:59:57,750 --> 01:59:58,625
No need, Munna.

1900
01:59:59,708 --> 02:00:00,500
Don't go.

1901
02:00:13,583 --> 02:00:14,333
Who is he?

1902
02:00:14,708 --> 02:00:15,708
He is our friend, aunty.

1903
02:00:18,708 --> 02:00:19,458
Namaste!

1904
02:00:21,416 --> 02:00:22,166
Who is it?

1905
02:00:22,458 --> 02:00:23,541
Is it Tony's gang?

1906
02:00:23,791 --> 02:00:24,500
Yes.

1907
02:00:26,083 --> 02:00:26,708
It's them.

1908
02:00:29,458 --> 02:00:30,375
Come Vikram.

1909
02:00:31,166 --> 02:00:33,333
We'll drag them out and beat them to dust.

1910
02:00:33,875 --> 02:00:35,250
-Okay, let's do this.
-Stop Vikram.

1911
02:00:38,625 --> 02:00:39,333
Chintanna...

1912
02:00:40,833 --> 02:00:42,291
Forget about hitting them back.

1913
02:00:42,416 --> 02:00:44,208
-What are you saying?
-I'll run, tomorrow.

1914
02:00:44,875 --> 02:00:45,708
And land that job.

1915
02:00:46,916 --> 02:00:48,500
I don't want anything else in this life.

1916
02:00:48,583 --> 02:00:49,291
Please bro.

1917
02:00:51,208 --> 02:00:53,166
I already hurt my parents a lot.

1918
02:01:00,208 --> 02:01:01,125
That's it.

1919
02:01:01,666 --> 02:01:02,625
We must stop this.

1920
02:01:03,375 --> 02:01:04,333
Okay... Your wish.

1921
02:01:35,958 --> 02:01:36,708
Munna...

1922
02:01:56,541 --> 02:01:57,041
Hey!

1923
02:01:58,333 --> 02:01:58,916
Are you sure?

1924
02:02:00,125 --> 02:02:01,166
Can you run today?

1925
02:02:05,958 --> 02:02:06,333
Mummy...

1926
02:02:07,166 --> 02:02:07,791
Munna...

1927
02:02:10,250 --> 02:02:10,958
Are you ready?

1928
02:02:13,041 --> 02:02:13,916
Have some sweetened curd.

1929
02:02:17,416 --> 02:02:18,125
Good boy.

1930
02:02:24,500 --> 02:02:25,958
Why don't you take dad's blessings too?

1931
02:02:26,000 --> 02:02:27,666
He didn't go the shop
worried about you.

1932
02:02:34,333 --> 02:02:34,666
Hey...

1933
02:02:36,125 --> 02:02:37,000
Atleast inform him.

1934
02:03:03,166 --> 02:03:04,583
Good.
He left on time.

1935
02:03:07,500 --> 02:03:08,791
Come.
I'll make tea for you.

1936
02:03:15,625 --> 02:03:16,500
What happened?

1937
02:03:18,958 --> 02:03:19,958
Why did you come back?

1938
02:03:39,666 --> 02:03:42,833
"Have tears gathered in your eyes?"

1939
02:03:42,875 --> 02:03:45,958
"As I gently lift
your face from your cheeks..."

1940
02:03:46,000 --> 02:03:49,208
"Hidden somewhere deep within you..."

1941
02:03:49,250 --> 02:03:52,375
"A battle has taught you what strength truly is"

1942
02:03:52,458 --> 02:03:55,500
"How can the one who merely watches know..."

1943
02:03:55,625 --> 02:03:58,791
"...the pain borne by the shoulders that carry the burden?"

1944
02:03:58,875 --> 02:04:02,041
"A treasure beyond any price, my dear..."

1945
02:04:02,083 --> 02:04:05,208
"It was hardship itself that raised and shaped you"

1946
02:04:05,250 --> 02:04:08,458
"Wounds are the provisions for
the journey to your destination..."

1947
02:04:08,500 --> 02:04:12,041
"The supplies for the road ahead"

1948
02:04:13,250 --> 02:04:18,791
"It's training...
it's preparation..."

1949
02:04:19,666 --> 02:04:25,125
"Even the fiercest storms are training"

1950
02:04:26,083 --> 02:04:31,666
"It's training...
it's preparation..."

1951
02:04:32,458 --> 02:04:37,625
"Even obstacles are training"

1952
02:04:40,833 --> 02:04:41,791
Hello, boss!

1953
02:04:41,916 --> 02:04:43,125
I have a government job.

1954
02:04:44,000 --> 02:04:45,583
You also crack a government job.
Go!

1955
02:04:47,000 --> 02:04:48,708
Ammu, you would wait for me, right?

1956
02:04:52,125 --> 02:04:56,541
"Again and again,
your image appears before me"

1957
02:04:57,750 --> 02:05:02,208
"Day and night,
I only think of you"

1958
02:05:02,958 --> 02:05:08,541
"Revealing yourself to me
with every opening layer"

1959
02:05:09,291 --> 02:05:14,291
"Appearing even with every batting eye"

1960
02:05:15,458 --> 02:05:18,750
"It's her, everywhere..."

1961
02:05:36,250 --> 02:05:38,916
AMMUU...

1962
02:05:40,416 --> 02:05:40,958
Hello.

1963
02:05:41,625 --> 02:05:42,583
I'm Munna's friend.

1964
02:05:42,833 --> 02:05:43,458
What is it?

1965
02:05:44,416 --> 02:05:45,333
He got the job.

1966
02:05:45,333 --> 02:05:46,458
He is coming to meet her.

1967
02:05:46,875 --> 02:05:47,416
Is it?

1968
02:05:47,500 --> 02:05:48,541
We didn't tell him.

1969
02:05:48,833 --> 02:05:50,291
-We won't either.
-Okay. Fine.

1970
02:05:50,375 --> 02:05:51,958
He'll be stunned
when he finds out.

1971
02:05:52,833 --> 02:05:53,916
Where are you now?

1972
02:05:55,041 --> 02:05:56,166
We are in the backstreet.

1973
02:05:57,583 --> 02:05:58,750
She better not come from tomorrow.

1974
02:06:00,000 --> 02:06:01,125
Ask her to get transfered.

1975
02:06:01,125 --> 02:06:02,333
Okay, I'll do something.

1976
02:06:08,125 --> 02:06:09,416
Looks like it's going to rain.

1977
02:06:09,625 --> 02:06:10,750
Shall we wait for some time?

1978
02:06:13,208 --> 02:06:14,666
Shall we wait till it starts raining?

1979
02:06:15,541 --> 02:06:16,875
Let's go now.

1980
02:06:17,166 --> 02:06:19,333
Actually... a friend is coming.

1981
02:06:19,583 --> 02:06:20,875
We can meet her and go.

1982
02:06:21,041 --> 02:06:22,166
Surya, place them there.

1983
02:06:23,041 --> 02:06:25,291
Who is this friend
I don't know about?

1984
02:06:35,458 --> 02:06:36,458
Is Munna coming?

1985
02:06:37,875 --> 02:06:39,041
Tell me the truth, Swapna.

1986
02:06:40,666 --> 02:06:42,041
How would I know if he's coming?

1987
02:06:42,458 --> 02:06:43,208
Tell me the truth.

1988
02:06:44,666 --> 02:06:45,208
Tell me.

1989
02:06:46,916 --> 02:06:47,625
He is coming.

1990
02:06:49,625 --> 02:06:51,041
Why don't you meet him?

1991
02:06:51,583 --> 02:06:53,500
He cracked a Government job.

1992
02:06:55,791 --> 02:06:57,916
He won't leave
even if he sees you like this.

1993
02:06:59,916 --> 02:07:01,041
You know it, right?

1994
02:07:01,958 --> 02:07:04,791
That I don't have
the courage to meet him.

1995
02:07:04,958 --> 02:07:06,958
If you are really my friend...

1996
02:07:08,208 --> 02:07:09,333
I am telling you seriously.

1997
02:07:10,166 --> 02:07:12,083
I will kill myself I tell you.

1998
02:07:13,416 --> 02:07:15,916
-Send him off. Make him leave.
-Ammu...

1999
02:07:16,166 --> 02:07:17,125
Send him away.

2000
02:07:18,375 --> 02:07:20,791
Make sure he doesn't come here.

2001
02:07:21,333 --> 02:07:24,083
Tell him something and send him away.
Please.

2002
02:07:24,333 --> 02:07:26,333
-Ask him to go.
-Not now.

2003
02:07:26,500 --> 02:07:28,875
We should stay here.
He might be around.

2004
02:07:30,791 --> 02:07:32,041
He will see you for sure.

2005
02:07:32,375 --> 02:07:33,416
I will send him away.

2006
02:07:33,583 --> 02:07:34,458
You wait inside.

2007
02:07:35,625 --> 02:07:36,458
Wait inside.

2008
02:07:36,708 --> 02:07:37,791
Surya, lock the door.

2009
02:07:44,166 --> 02:07:45,333
Munna will come now.

2010
02:07:45,333 --> 02:07:47,625
Don't let him know anything about Munna.
Okay?

2011
02:07:49,166 --> 02:07:51,458
Didn’t I say
we should’ve come earlier?

2012
02:07:52,458 --> 02:07:53,375
Swapna, stop.

2013
02:07:54,208 --> 02:07:55,208
-Hi!
-Munna...

2014
02:07:55,666 --> 02:07:57,458
Didn't see you in a long time.

2015
02:07:58,125 --> 02:07:59,166
Did you forget?

2016
02:07:59,416 --> 02:08:01,208
Your friend asked me to meet
only after I get a job.

2017
02:08:02,125 --> 02:08:03,375
She is not here.

2018
02:08:03,625 --> 02:08:06,208
I think she moved to Delhi or Mumbai.

2019
02:08:12,083 --> 02:08:13,500
Delhi? Or Mumbai?

2020
02:08:15,083 --> 02:08:16,083
I don't know, Munna.

2021
02:08:16,333 --> 02:08:18,000
Her entire family has moved.

2022
02:08:20,375 --> 02:08:20,875
Really?

2023
02:08:21,500 --> 02:08:22,208
Please, Swapna.

2024
02:08:22,416 --> 02:08:24,375
She doesn't even reply to me.

2025
02:08:25,208 --> 02:08:26,541
Where do I look for her now?

2026
02:08:27,166 --> 02:08:28,916
Tell me if you know, Swapna.
Please.

2027
02:08:33,958 --> 02:08:35,583
Forget it.
She is not meant for you.

2028
02:08:36,583 --> 02:08:37,375
What's wrong with you?

2029
02:08:38,291 --> 02:08:39,166
Have you gone mad?

2030
02:08:39,333 --> 02:08:40,333
Are even friends?

2031
02:08:41,041 --> 02:08:42,083
Don't you understand?

2032
02:08:42,083 --> 02:08:43,833
-She's saying...
-Ammu is gone.

2033
02:08:44,333 --> 02:08:45,375
We don't know
where she went.

2034
02:08:46,875 --> 02:08:48,125
Why are you talking like this?

2035
02:08:48,458 --> 02:08:49,541
Swapna, tell me.

2036
02:08:49,875 --> 02:08:50,916
Where did she go?

2037
02:08:51,250 --> 02:08:52,583
I don't know, Munna.
Really.

2038
02:08:52,916 --> 02:08:53,458
Uncle...

2039
02:08:53,666 --> 02:08:54,583
Munna...

2040
02:08:54,750 --> 02:08:55,291
Surya...

2041
02:08:57,916 --> 02:08:58,333
Surya...

2042
02:08:58,458 --> 02:08:59,000
Tell me, Surya.

2043
02:08:59,375 --> 02:09:00,375
Do you know, Surya?

2044
02:09:00,583 --> 02:09:01,958
Do you know
where Ammu has gone?

2045
02:09:02,041 --> 02:09:02,958
I don't know.

2046
02:09:03,458 --> 02:09:05,583
She hasn't been coming to office.

2047
02:09:20,083 --> 02:09:20,750
Fine, don't tell me!

2048
02:09:20,958 --> 02:09:23,083
-I'll find her. -She's not here.
Why don't you understand?

2049
02:09:23,083 --> 02:09:24,708
-Munna...
-Move. -Listen to me.

2050
02:09:24,958 --> 02:09:26,333
First hear me out.
Hey...

2051
02:09:26,625 --> 02:09:27,708
Please don't cry.

2052
02:09:28,041 --> 02:09:29,250
What is this?

2053
02:09:32,000 --> 02:09:33,833
Don't cry like a fool.
She is not here.

2054
02:09:33,833 --> 02:09:35,791
What can you do?
Where will you go?

2055
02:09:35,791 --> 02:09:36,625
Move aside.

2056
02:09:38,625 --> 02:09:39,541
Munna...

2057
02:09:40,333 --> 02:09:41,291
Please don't cry.

2058
02:09:44,083 --> 02:09:45,375
What is this?

2059
02:09:45,375 --> 02:09:45,875
Munna.

2060
02:09:50,041 --> 02:09:50,791
Let's go home.

2061
02:09:50,958 --> 02:09:52,083
You start that bike.

2062
02:09:52,583 --> 02:09:53,083
Munna!

2063
02:09:59,166 --> 02:09:59,666
Swapna...

2064
02:10:00,791 --> 02:10:01,958
You are hiding something, right?

2065
02:10:04,541 --> 02:10:05,333
Tell me, Swapna.

2066
02:10:06,375 --> 02:10:07,125
Please, Swapna.

2067
02:10:07,166 --> 02:10:08,250
Tell me where Ammu is.

2068
02:10:08,625 --> 02:10:10,333
You really loved her, didn’t you?

2069
02:10:12,791 --> 02:10:14,583
-So?
-What's all this?

2070
02:10:14,583 --> 02:10:16,708
She loves you even more.

2071
02:10:26,500 --> 02:10:28,708
Ammu also loves me.
I knew it.

2072
02:10:30,583 --> 02:10:31,166
But...

2073
02:10:31,208 --> 02:10:32,291
But she won't meet you.

2074
02:10:34,291 --> 02:10:35,125
She's not interested.

2075
02:10:35,250 --> 02:10:36,875
If she doesn't want to meet, let's go.

2076
02:10:36,875 --> 02:10:39,125
-We should go now.
-What's wrong with her? Is she mad?

2077
02:10:42,000 --> 02:10:43,666
She says she will quit her job
if you see her.

2078
02:10:44,500 --> 02:10:45,458
She says she will die.

2079
02:10:46,083 --> 02:10:46,583
Munna...

2080
02:10:47,416 --> 02:10:48,416
Not fair.

2081
02:10:49,916 --> 02:10:51,833
-She says she will kill herself.
-She will die.

2082
02:10:54,541 --> 02:10:56,125
Please leave, Munna.

2083
02:11:34,375 --> 02:11:36,541
She is disabled in her legs.

2084
02:11:38,333 --> 02:11:39,791
Is that her problem?

2085
02:12:07,625 --> 02:12:08,541
Did you know that?

2086
02:12:10,791 --> 02:12:12,041
-Do I know?
-How did you know?

2087
02:12:13,541 --> 02:12:14,833
What do you mean if I know, Swapna?

2088
02:12:16,833 --> 02:12:18,333
Doesn't she know that I know?

2089
02:12:18,750 --> 02:12:19,625
Didn't you know this?

2090
02:12:22,708 --> 02:12:24,625
That's not at all a problem for me, Swapna.

2091
02:12:26,125 --> 02:12:28,333
It means nothing to me.

2092
02:12:30,250 --> 02:12:32,625
I didn't tell them about it
as they wouldn't understand her.

2093
02:12:39,541 --> 02:12:41,375
How can I not know, Swapna?

2094
02:12:43,416 --> 02:12:44,750
After the first time I saw her

2095
02:12:45,875 --> 02:12:47,291
I came again the next morning.

2096
02:12:49,666 --> 02:12:51,625
I saw her on the scooty then.

2097
02:12:54,291 --> 02:12:55,750
My heart sunk, Swapna.

2098
02:13:20,500 --> 02:13:21,708
I cried the whole day.

2099
02:13:22,666 --> 02:13:23,458
I cried a lot.

2100
02:13:24,333 --> 02:13:25,375
But what can I do?

2101
02:13:26,208 --> 02:13:27,833
I can't stop loving her.

2102
02:13:28,291 --> 02:13:29,958
I keeps growing every day.

2103
02:13:37,000 --> 02:13:38,958
Do you love her out of sympathy?

2104
02:13:44,166 --> 02:13:45,375
What about sympathy?

2105
02:13:47,875 --> 02:13:49,291
I am mad about her.

2106
02:13:50,500 --> 02:13:53,333
She makes me feel love, lust, anger, everything.

2107
02:13:56,041 --> 02:13:58,166
I have all kinds of emotions for her.

2108
02:14:04,291 --> 02:14:05,125
For a minute...

2109
02:14:05,750 --> 02:14:07,708
My heart skipped a beat for a moment.

2110
02:14:10,083 --> 02:14:10,708
Let's go.

2111
02:14:11,375 --> 02:14:12,375
Take me to her.

2112
02:14:13,291 --> 02:14:15,083
Tell her that Munna has got the job.

2113
02:14:15,541 --> 02:14:16,083
Let's go, Swapna.

2114
02:14:16,333 --> 02:14:16,916
Let's go to her.

2115
02:14:17,208 --> 02:14:17,708
Tell me.

2116
02:14:18,375 --> 02:14:19,208
You tell her.

2117
02:14:22,125 --> 02:14:23,041
She is right here.

2118
02:14:23,791 --> 02:14:24,375
Tell her.

2119
02:14:27,416 --> 02:14:28,000
Inside?

2120
02:14:33,125 --> 02:14:33,833
Go, tell her.

2121
02:14:38,458 --> 02:14:39,000
Ammu...

2122
02:14:39,708 --> 02:14:40,208
Ammu.

2123
02:14:41,500 --> 02:14:42,375
Surya, open the door.

2124
02:14:47,875 --> 02:14:48,541
Ammu...

2125
02:14:50,625 --> 02:14:51,125
Ammu.

2126
02:14:51,583 --> 02:14:52,291
Open the door.

2127
02:14:52,958 --> 02:14:54,083
Why did you close the door?

2128
02:14:57,083 --> 02:14:58,208
I love you, Ammu.

2129
02:14:59,291 --> 02:15:00,125
I hate you.

2130
02:15:00,875 --> 02:15:02,166
Go away.
Leave

2131
02:15:03,458 --> 02:15:05,166
Look at my face and say
that you hate me.

2132
02:15:05,916 --> 02:15:07,666
Then I will never show my face again.

2133
02:16:00,333 --> 02:16:00,791
What?

2134
02:16:03,625 --> 02:16:04,416
I got the job.

2135
02:16:05,041 --> 02:16:05,916
Government job.

2136
02:16:06,791 --> 02:16:07,333
So?

2137
02:16:08,250 --> 02:16:09,750
You said you'll accept me if I get a job.

2138
02:16:10,375 --> 02:16:11,250
I got now

2139
02:16:12,583 --> 02:16:13,458
I said that

2140
02:16:14,375 --> 02:16:15,666
to make you go away.

2141
02:16:16,000 --> 02:16:17,000
Don't say that, Ammu.

2142
02:16:18,416 --> 02:16:19,500
I love you, Ammu.

2143
02:16:20,458 --> 02:16:21,458
I don't love you.

2144
02:16:22,458 --> 02:16:23,000
Leave.

2145
02:16:26,000 --> 02:16:26,500
Okay.

2146
02:16:27,416 --> 02:16:28,125
I will go away.

2147
02:16:28,833 --> 02:16:30,208
But I don't want to live.

2148
02:16:30,458 --> 02:16:31,291
Oh God!

2149
02:16:31,916 --> 02:16:34,083
I don't want to live a life without you.

2150
02:16:35,916 --> 02:16:36,541
Come here.

2151
02:16:38,041 --> 02:16:38,750
Come here.

2152
02:16:39,375 --> 02:16:39,875
Come.

2153
02:16:41,458 --> 02:16:41,916
Stand here.

2154
02:16:49,208 --> 02:16:50,375
What are you doing?

2155
02:16:51,000 --> 02:16:51,708
Just watch me.

2156
02:17:23,583 --> 02:17:24,791
Look at me now and say.

2157
02:17:27,291 --> 02:17:28,875
Do you still love me?

2158
02:17:29,541 --> 02:17:31,000
And cannot live without me?

2159
02:17:33,625 --> 02:17:35,166
Leave it.
Why are you covering again?

2160
02:17:41,083 --> 02:17:42,875
I can't live without you, Ammu.

2161
02:17:45,375 --> 02:17:46,083
Please.

2162
02:17:46,458 --> 02:17:48,083
Please, go away.

2163
02:17:49,750 --> 02:17:50,333
Okay.

2164
02:17:50,458 --> 02:17:51,541
You also come with me.

2165
02:17:51,916 --> 02:17:53,666
Oh God!
Please, Munna.

2166
02:17:53,708 --> 02:17:55,416
Please.
I can't do this.

2167
02:17:56,958 --> 02:17:59,083
If you ever regret

2168
02:18:00,125 --> 02:18:04,291
or get frustrated after marrying me...

2169
02:18:04,875 --> 02:18:06,541
I can't bear it, Munna.

2170
02:18:07,208 --> 02:18:07,958
I will be.

2171
02:18:09,250 --> 02:18:10,208
I will be frustrated.

2172
02:18:10,916 --> 02:18:11,875
You'll also get frustrated.

2173
02:18:12,375 --> 02:18:14,000
I will annoy you a lot.

2174
02:18:14,041 --> 02:18:16,541
We must have all emotions
that a husband and wife have.

2175
02:18:17,583 --> 02:18:22,791
We should laugh, cry, beat, scold, kiss, love and live together.

2176
02:18:24,083 --> 02:18:26,083
I can't let you spoil your life.

2177
02:18:26,750 --> 02:18:27,750
I can't do that.

2178
02:18:32,458 --> 02:18:34,708
I don't see life without you, Ammu.

2179
02:18:36,041 --> 02:18:37,500
I will kill myself.

2180
02:18:38,500 --> 02:18:40,125
I will also kill myself.

2181
02:18:54,458 --> 02:18:55,166
No, Munna.

2182
02:18:56,125 --> 02:18:56,583
No.

2183
02:18:57,125 --> 02:18:57,833
Again...

2184
02:18:58,333 --> 02:19:00,416
You will get angry tomorrow.

2185
02:19:00,833 --> 02:19:02,458
If you get irritated,

2186
02:19:02,541 --> 02:19:03,750
you will hit me.

2187
02:19:04,375 --> 02:19:05,458
Then, you also hit me.

2188
02:19:07,333 --> 02:19:08,166
Hit me now.

2189
02:19:08,625 --> 02:19:09,458
Come on, beat me.

2190
02:19:09,625 --> 02:19:10,500
Hit me.

2191
02:19:41,958 --> 02:19:42,541
I Love you

2192
02:19:43,416 --> 02:19:44,458
I Love you, Munna

2193
02:19:45,125 --> 02:19:45,750
I Love you

2194
02:19:46,875 --> 02:19:47,500
I Love you

